msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/007"
msgid "잠시만.../10d마음을 편히 하고 눈을 감고 계셔주세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/008"
msgid "만능한 마나의 힘이시여... /10d나의 염원으로 기적을..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/009"
msgid "!! /10d이것은..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/010"
msgid "자..이제 무리만 하지 않으시면 됩니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/011"
msgid "사막에서.../15d 저를 구해 주신겁니까...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/012"
msgid "다행히도 이제는 건강하신것 같네요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/013"
msgid "저는 프리토리아에 사는 에스메랄다라고 합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/014"
msgid "..../10d 감사합니다. /n/15d실례지만 성함이..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/015"
msgid "지금은 보답할 것이 없습니다만, 이 은혜는 언젠가 꼭 갚겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/016"
msgid "그런 것은 신경쓰지 마시고, 몸 관리에 주의하세요. /10d좀 특이한 체질이신 것 같은데.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/017"
msgid "죄송합니다만, 저는 일이 있어서 더 이상 옆에 있어 드릴 수가 없네요. /n그럼 이만..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/018"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/019"
msgid "다카마항으로 가는 배를 타야 할텐데..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/020"
msgid "아, 죄송하지만 잠시.../10d 폭풍도..../15d 혹시 여기서 폭풍도로 어떻게 가는지 아십니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/021"
msgid "폭풍도라면.../10d 대륙 동부에서 남쪽으로 한참 밑에 있으니 여기서 바로 가는 배는 없을거예요./30d 일단 다카마항으로 가셔서 그 곳에서 배를 새로 타셔야 될겁니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/022"
msgid "다카마항이라.../15d 고맙습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s05|@kfl03_s05/023"
msgid "그럼..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/000"
msgid "/2c다카마. 부두."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/001"
msgid "이 배는 폭풍도로 향하는 팬드래건의 연락선이오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/002"
msgid "미안하지만 탑승할 수는 없소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/003"
msgid "이 배가 폭풍도로 떠나는 연락선인데.../10d 이제 어떻게 한다.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/004"
msgid "이보게!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/005"
msgid "!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/006"
msgid "아..선장님."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/007"
msgid "어떤가, 출발준비는?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/008"
msgid "예. 모든것이 순조롭습니다. /n아마도 내일 새벽즈음 출항할 수 있을것입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/009"
msgid "좋아. /n모두들 수고했네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/010"
msgid "그런데, 다들 식사는 했나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/011"
msgid "예.? /n아직..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/012"
msgid "역시 그런가? /n내가 출항기념으로 거하게 쓸테니, 주점으로 따라오게."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/013"
msgid "그럼..이곳은.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/014"
msgid "하하하 걱정말게. 폭풍도에 가고 싶어하는 사람이 있을리 없지 않나./n괜찮으니 어서들 가세."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/015"
msgid "......기회군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/016"
msgid "이 배가 폭풍도로 떠나는 연락선인데.../10d 이제 어떻게 한다.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/017"
msgid "어떻게 하시겠습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/018"
msgid "선원에게 사정을 잘 말해 본다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/019"
msgid "숨어서 기회를 엿본다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/020"
msgid "별 수 없지.../10d 선원에게 사정을 잘 이야기하면 태워줄지도..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/021"
msgid "미안합니다만, 폭풍도까지 태워줄 수 없겠습니까?/30d 저는 꼭 그 곳에 가야만 합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/022"
msgid "응?/15d 이 배를 타고 싶다고?/20d /n안되지, 이 배는 폭풍도에 계신..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/023"
msgid "잠깐, 그렇지 않아도 심심했는데/15d 이 사람에게도 기회를 한번 줘보자구."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/024"
msgid "기회라니?/15d 어떻게 말이야?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/025"
msgid "내가 몇가지 문제를 낼테니 한번 맞춰 보겠나? 문제에 제대로 답한다면 폭풍도까지 태워주지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/026"
msgid "선택의 여지가 없지 않겠소?/20d 그곳까지 태워만 준다면 뭐든 해보겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/027"
msgid "흐음... 거 괜찮은 생각인걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/028"
msgid "좋아, 문제를 잘 맞추면 우리 두 사람이 책임지고 폭풍도까지 태워주지!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/029"
msgid "그럼 시작하네! 문제를 잘 듣고 답해보게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/030"
msgid "과거 창세전쟁 당시 팬드래건, 아스타니아, 다갈, 커티스의 동부 4개 국가 연합의 명칭은 무엇이었는지 아는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/031"
msgid "다크아머 연합"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/032"
msgid "실버애로우 연합"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/033"
msgid "두번째 문제는 내가 내보지./15d 셋중에 골라보게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/034"
msgid "창세전쟁의 원흉인 베라딘은 암흑신의 전인이었지./20d 그는 무엇을 관장하는 암흑신의 전인이었는지 아는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/035"
msgid "음모"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/036"
msgid "파멸"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/037"
msgid "전쟁"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/038"
msgid "저런저런, 틀려버렸군./20d 다크아머는 게이시르, 트리시스, 가라드 서부 3국의 제국연합을 일컷는 것이였어./20d 검은 깃발이라고도 불리웠었지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/039"
msgid "동부국가의 4국연합은 실버애로우라는 이름으로, 팬드래건을 중심으로 이루어진 연합이었지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/040"
msgid "상식인데 모르고 있었구만./n 다음 문제는 잘 생각해서 맞춰보게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/041"
msgid "역시 맞췄군./15d 하긴, 문제가 쉽긴 쉬웠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/042"
msgid "물론 다크아머가 게이시르, 트리시스, 가라드 서부 3국의 제국연합을 일컷는 것이였다는 것도 알고 있겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/043"
msgid "두번째 문제부터는 난이도를 조금 높여야겠는걸?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/044"
msgid "호오, 단번에 맞춰버리는군./20d 그렇지, 베라딘은 암흑신 '음모의 베라모드'의 전인이였다지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/045"
msgid "문제가 조금 어려웠던가?/15d 파멸을 관장하는 암흑신은 '파멸의 유스타시아'라네. 베라딘과는 상관 없을걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/046"
msgid "다음 문제는 조금 쉬워질거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/047"
msgid "저런저런, 전쟁의 암흑신은 '전쟁의 샤크바리' 여신이야./20d 베라딘과는 상관 없어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/048"
msgid "좀 잘 해봐."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/049"
msgid "이번에는 커티스쪽이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/050"
msgid "대륙 유일의 공화정을 펼치고 있는 커티스의 초대 대통령의 이름이 뭔지 아는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/051"
msgid "아리아나"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/052"
msgid "아리아나 쥬니어"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/053"
msgid "아르시아"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/054"
msgid "아르시아 쥬니어"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/055"
msgid "흐음, 잘 알고있군. 커티스의 초대 대통령은 아르시아./20d 아리아나와 아리아나 쥬니어는 그를 뒷받침해준 인물이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/056"
msgid "아리아나는 당시 신궁이라 불리웠던 사람으로, 커티스 공화국의 초석이 된 사람이긴 하지만./30d 대통령의 자리에 오른적은 없다구."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/057"
msgid "근대사라서 쉬울줄 알았는데, 헷갈렸나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/058"
msgid "아리아나 쥬니어는 신궁 아리아나의 아들이자 커티스 공화정을 이끈 주요 인물이지만 공화국 건립 당시에는 너무 어렸다구."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/059"
msgid "미안하지만 틀렸다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/060"
msgid "푸후후, 설마 이런 함정에 속을줄은 몰랐는걸?/20d 아르시아 쥬니어라는 인물은 없었어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/061"
msgid "착각한걸수도 있지만, 어쨌든 틀렸구만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/062"
msgid "이번 문제는 모르면 폭풍도에 태워다주는게 꺼려지겠는걸./20d 이건 반드시 맞춰보게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/063"
msgid "폭풍도에 계신 이올린님은 우리 팬드래건의 라시드 폐하와 어떤 관계인 분인지 알고있나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/064"
msgid "라시드 폐하의 어머니"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/065"
msgid "라시드 폐하의 누님"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/066"
msgid "라시드 폐하의 누이동생"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/067"
msgid "라시드 폐하의 따님"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/068"
msgid "역시나 맞췄군./15d 하긴 이올린님이 라시드 폐하의 누님이라는 유명한 사실을 모르는 사람은 드물겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/069"
msgid "자, 그럼 마지막 문제까지 잘 해보라구."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/070"
msgid "쯔쯧... 라시드 폐하의 따님이 50년 전부터 폭풍도에 계실리가 없지./30d 라시드 폐하의 장녀는 아직 마흔도 안되었단 말일세."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/071"
msgid "그나저나 이올린님에 대해 잘 모르는 모양인데.../20d 폭풍도에 데려가기가 좀 꺼려지는걸..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/072"
msgid "저런저런... 라시드 폐하의 양친은 모두 창세전쟁 초기 그라테스 회전에서 전사하셔서 지금까지 생존해 계시질 않는다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/073"
msgid "으음... 자네는 예상외의 답을 하는군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/074"
msgid "맞았어./10d 아르시아는 커티스 공화국의 초대 대통령./15d 아리아나와 아리아나 쥬니어는 그를 뒷받침 해준 인물이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/075"
msgid "근대사는 생각보다 잘 맞추는 걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/076"
msgid "으음... 두분이 남매사이인 것은 맞았지만.../20d 이올린님이 손윗분이시지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/077"
msgid "쩝..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/078"
msgid "이번이 마지막 문제야./15d 쉽지는 않을걸세."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/079"
msgid "창세전쟁 당시에는 전대륙 최강의 검사라고 불리운 4명의 검사가 있었지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/080"
msgid "게이시르 제국의 흑태자, 팬드래건 왕국의 라시드 팬드래건, 제국 7용사이자 4천왕이였던 칼스 대장군, 그리고 방랑 검객 크로우."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/081"
msgid "이 4명을 두고 세인들은 각자의 성격과 검술에 맞는 칭호를 붙여 부르기 시작했지./30d 자 그러면 여기서 질문!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/082"
msgid "창세전쟁의 4대 검사중 칼스 대장군이 불리웠던 호칭은 무엇인지 답해보게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl03_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl03_s06|@kfl03_s06/083"
msgid "검황"
msgstr ""

