msgid "그건 그렇고, 카나는 정신이 있는거야?  /10d /n부하들을 남겨놓고 자리를 비우다니!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/007"
msgid "후우~/15d /n설마 루벤공작이 그렇게 빨리 돌아오리라고는 예상을 못했어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/008"
msgid "마침 이 근방에 주둔하고 있던 이루스 장군에게 찾아갔던 모양입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/009"
msgid "카나 님이 예측 못할 수 밖에 없었다고 생각합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/010"
msgid "카나! 과정이야 어떻게 되었던, 부하를 희생한 것은 모두 대장의 책임이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/011"
msgid "클라우제비츠, /10d /n이 일이 해결된 후에는 적절한 문책이 있어야 할 것입니다. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/012"
msgid "언니.../15d미안해요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/013"
msgid "그런데, 뒤에 계시는 분들은?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/014"
msgid "아, 이번에 우리일에 크게 도움을 주신 분들이예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/015"
msgid "카나! 외부인을 이곳에 데려오다니... /15d /n지금 제 정신이니?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/016"
msgid "하지만, 이 분들 덕분에 라몬자작령도 해방시킬수 있었단 말이예요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/017"
msgid "저도 그 이야기는 들었습니다만.../n세분이서 자작저택을 초토화 시켰다는 것이 사실입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/018"
msgid "정말 대단하신 분들이에요. /n모두들 실력들이 초일류에요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/019"
msgid "그렇다고는 해도 우리의 극비모임 장소에 외부인을 데려온 것은 경솔한 행동이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/020"
msgid "흥! 뭐가 그렇게 대단한지는 모르겠지만 정말 꼴불견이군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/021"
msgid "집안 싸움은 알아서들 하시고, 우리도 이쪽에 붙어있고 싶은 생각은 없으니 이곳을 떠나자고요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/022"
msgid "그러지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/023"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/024"
msgid "에스메랄다 님은 이곳에 남는 것이 좋을 것 같군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/025"
msgid "아닙니다. 실례가 안된다면 시라노 님과 함께 행동하면 좋겠군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/026"
msgid "혹시,프리토리아의 유명한 성녀 에스메랄다 님이 아니신가요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/027"
msgid "성녀라니요. 일개 의사에 불과하답니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/028"
msgid "아닙니다. 에스메랄다님이라면 저희가 여러 번 초빙하려고 하셨던 제국령 최고의 명의십니다"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/029"
msgid "이런곳에서 뵐줄은..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/030"
msgid "죄송합니다. /n클라우제비츠 님의 편지는 여러 번 받아 봤습니다만, 환자들이 많아서 자리를 뜰수 없었습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/031"
msgid "이렇게 된 이상 저희와 함께 행동하는 것이..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/032"
msgid "그렇지만, 저는 이미 이분들에게 크나큰 은혜를 입었답니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/033"
msgid "죄송하지만 저도 이분들을 따라 이곳을 떠나야겠네요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/034"
msgid "그러실 필요 없습니다, 에스메랄다 님. /n저희에게 신경쓰시지 말고 이곳에 남으시지요"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/035"
msgid "성녀 에스메랄다 님과 함께 다니시는 분들이라면 신용할 수 있습니다. /n여러분들도 저희 제피르팰컨에 동참하시지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/036"
msgid "쳇, 갑자기 태도가 완전히 틀려지는군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/037"
msgid "미안하지만 이쪽에도 할일이...."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/038"
msgid "[메디치] /n여어! 늦어서 미안하군, 여러분."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/039"
msgid "형님은 또 지각이군요! /n이번엔, 또 무슨일이죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/040"
msgid "이번에도 위험했어요! /n불붙어 다 타들어 가는 집안에 들어가서 4남매를 구해냈다니까요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/041"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/042"
msgid "메디치, 넌 제피르팰컨의 실질적인 대장이잖아. 그러다가, 사고라도 나면..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/043"
msgid "뭐, 그래도 곤경에 빠진 사람들을 모른체 할수도 없잖아?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/044"
msgid "역시, 로베르토 데 메디치다운 말씀이시군요"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/045"
msgid "....../10d로베르토 데 메디치"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/046"
msgid "그래.../10d로베르토 데 메디치.../10d제피르팰컨..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/047"
msgid "아는 사람입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/048"
msgid "음..? /15d 아아..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/049"
msgid "그건 그렇고, 이번에 카나의 부하들이 곤경에 빠졌다면서?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/050"
msgid "이루스 장군이 개입한 모양입니다. /n 이루스 장군이라면 제국 최고의 맹장으로 과거 제국 4천왕으로 꼽히던 전설적인 인물입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/051"
msgid "음, 바로 그 이루스라면 오히려 카나가 그 자리에 없었던 것이 다행일지도 모르겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/052"
msgid "아무래도 이루스 장군은 메디치 님이 맡아주셔야 할것 같습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/053"
msgid "흐음.../10d 나라고 해도 그 사람을 상대할수 있을지 모르겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/054"
msgid "오빠, 미안해요..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/055"
msgid "하하하, 하지만 카나의 부하들을 그대로 놔둘수는 없지. /n좋아, 이루스 장군에게 본때를 보여주자고!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/056"
msgid "그런데.../10d 못보던 사람들이 있군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/057"
msgid "저희가 영입하려던 에스메랄다 님과 동행하시는 분들입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/058"
msgid "여러분들도 저희를 도와 작전에 참가해 주시겠습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/059"
msgid "아까의 일은 제가 사과드리겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/060"
msgid "흥, 이미 늦었..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/061"
msgid "좋소. /n일단 같이 행동하도록 하겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/062"
msgid "!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/063"
msgid "좋아요! /n시라노 님은 저희 4부대에 들어와 함께 움직이도록 해요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/064"
msgid "좋아요! /n시라노 님은 저희 4부대에 들어와 함께 움직이도록 해요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/065"
msgid "그럼, 카라카스 공격작전을 설명드리겠습니다"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/066"
msgid "먼저, 이자벨 님이 이끄는 2부대와 리델하트 님의 3부대는 마을 양쪽을 동시에 공격하여 적들을 혼란시켜 주십시요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/067"
msgid "잠입에 성공하면 메디치 님은 영주저택 정면으로 공격해 주십시요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/068"
msgid "메디치 님이 이루스 장군을 상대하는 사이, 카나 님은 지하수로를 이용해 저택지하로 들어가 잡힌 포로들을 구출하는 작전입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s01|@kfl08_s01/069"
msgid "자, 그럼 구 제국의 4천왕 님과 상대해 보도록 할까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/000"
msgid "/2c저택의 내부."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/001"
msgid "후후, 예전의 공부 벌레 모습은 흔적도 없어지고 아주 강해졌더군. /n시라노 번스타인."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/002"
msgid "설마 4천왕의 한명이었던 이루스 장군을 격파할 줄이야..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/003"
msgid "루벤...오래간만이군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/004"
msgid "시라노, 15년전부터 오늘같은 날이 올것을 알고 있었지 직감적으로..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/005"
msgid "어째서였지? /n왜 형제처럼 지내던 네가 나를 배반한 것이지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/006"
msgid "형제...후후, 당신이 나의 진짜 형이 아니었다면 절대로 배반하지 않았을거다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/007"
msgid "그게 무슨말이지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/008"
msgid "미안하지만 그 전에 할일이 있지않나? /n시라노 번스타인."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/009"
msgid "당신을 위해서 몇가지 장난감을 준비해 두었지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/010"
msgid "머신건이라고 들어봤나? /n동방에서 건너온 물건인데 위력이 대단하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/011"
msgid "왔는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/012"
msgid "어디 암흑신을 멸살시킨 실력을 구경해 볼까."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/013"
msgid "네가 어떻게 이루스가 암흑신인것을..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/014"
msgid "이런, 나를 그렇게 과소평가 했었다니...실망인걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/015"
msgid "이런이런.. 생각보다 서두가 너무 길어졌군. /n조심하게나, 이 장난감은 생각보다 위험하다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/016"
msgid "불멸의 육체도 산산히 분해시켜버릴 정도로!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/017"
msgid "크윽..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/018"
msgid "루벤...왜..?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/019"
msgid "이건../5d내가 원한 길.../5d15년전부터../5d이 날이 오기만을 기다렸어.../5d나의 친형을 배반한 이후로..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/020"
msgid "친형이라니 !!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/021"
msgid "후후.../3d역시 모르고 있었군.../n우린 배다른 형제야../3d.모두 아버지인 루크 번스타인의 피가 섞인..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/022"
msgid "그런 아버지도..나 때문에 돌아가셨지. /n지금까지.../4d정말로 외롭고 괴로웠어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/023"
msgid "그래도, 마지막으로 행복해. /10d그나마, 형의 손에 죽는다니 /4d조금이나마..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/024"
msgid "바보녀석!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/025"
msgid "형, 체사레를 /5d조심해...형을 함정에 빠뜨린 것은 바로 체사레야. /10d /n이스카리옷도 나도 모두 그의..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/026"
msgid ".....체사레./15d/n 이번일도 체사레와 연관이 있었단 말인가."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/027"
msgid "체사레 보르자..../10d /n너와의 이 피비린내 나는 악연../10d내손으로 거두어 주마."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s03|@kfl08_s03/028"
msgid "으윽.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/000"
msgid "/2c저택앞."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/001"
msgid "아! 무사하셨군요./15d /n루벤 공작은 어떻게 되었죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/002"
msgid "...조금전에 숨을 거두었소. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/003"
msgid "과연! /n대단한 실력이로군. /n아뭏든 정말 고마웠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/004"
msgid "흥! 설마 우리 대형을 구해 주었다고 생색내는 것은 아니겠지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/005"
msgid "천만에, 운이 좋았을 뿐이요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/006"
msgid "그럴리가, 나는 메디치 경을 잠깐 거들었을 뿐이오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl08_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl08_s04|@kfl08_s04/007"
