msgid "그럼, 카나와 카라카스까지 함께 가보도록 할까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s02|@kfl10_s02/044"
msgid "우리는 지리도 익힐겸 따로 움직이도록 하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/000"
msgid "제피르팰컨분들이십니까?/30d /n영주님께서 기다리고 계셨습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/001"
msgid "팰컨의 다른분들도 도착했나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/002"
msgid "예, 예 모두 기다리고 계십니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/003"
msgid "시라노 님, 도착하셨군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/004"
msgid "군사! 먼저 와 계셨군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/005"
msgid "예, 메디치 님을 제외하고는 모두 와계십니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/006"
msgid "역시... 메디치 씨는 또 늦는군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/007"
msgid "메디치 님은 적잖게 기다려야 도착하리라 생각되니/20d 우선, 주인인 에스테도데 님을 만나 보시는 것이 좋을 것 같습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/008"
msgid "알겠소, 주인을 만나보도록 하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s03|@kfl10_s03/009"
msgid "/2c에스테도데 저택. 로비."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/000"
msgid "에스테도데 님이 나오십니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/001"
msgid "안녕하세요./30d /n제가 이 곳 리브레빌의 영주인 에스테도데입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/002"
msgid "저야말로 제 부탁을 듣고 이렇게 와주셔서 정말 뭐라 감사드려야 할지..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/003"
msgid "제국령 최고의 선정통치로 유명하신 에스테도데 님께서 이렇게 초대해 주시다니, 영광입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/004"
msgid "그런데, 최근 곤란한 일이 있으시다고 들었습니다만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/005"
msgid "실은.../30d 그 문제 때문에 이렇게 여러분들을 모시게 된 거예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/006"
msgid "[메디치]/n미인의 입에서 한숨이 나오게 만든 그 문제가 대체 뭐요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/007"
msgid "메디치 대장..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/008"
msgid "메디치 오빠!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/009"
msgid "형님!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/010"
msgid "메디치 님?/n당신이 바로 메디치 님이시군요./30d /n뵙게 되어 정말 기뻐요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/011"
msgid "아, 여러분 미안./n늦어버렸군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/012"
msgid "에스테도데 님의 영지를 한번 둘러보니, 역시 리브레빌은 다른 영지들과는 달리 정말 온화하고 살기 좋은 고장이라는 생각이 들더군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/013"
msgid "메디치 오빠, 초청 받은 자리까지 이렇게 늦는건 정말 곤란해요!/n기다리시는 분께 실례잖아요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/014"
msgid "호호, 아니 저는 괜찮아요. 그렇게 까지 면박을 주실 것 까지는 없잖아요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/015"
msgid "저는 메디치 님을 뵌 것만으로도 감격했는걸요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/016"
msgid "하하하, 그렇게 까지... 몸둘 바를 모르겠군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/017"
msgid "호호호"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/018"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/019"
msgid "어쨌든 먼길을 오시느라 피곤 하셨을테니 일단은 객실로 안내해 드리겠습니다./n만찬 후에 살롱에서 다시 뵙도록 하지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/020"
msgid "그럼 저는 먼저 실례하겠습니다. 모두 편히 쉬어주세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/021"
msgid "손님 분들은 저를 따라 오십시요. 객실을 안내해 드리겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/022"
msgid "크하, 진짜 여자란 바로 저런 여자를 두고 하는 말이 아니겠어?/n저 나긋나긋함, 게다가 아름다운 용모에 영주로서의 능력까지..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/023"
msgid "실버 생각은 어떤가."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/024"
msgid "그다지../30d 단지, 지나치게 친절한 걸요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s04
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s04|@kfl10_s04/025"
msgid "그녀의 친절은 공짜가 아니니까./30d 하지만 경계는 필요 할 것 같군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/000"
msgid "식사는 잘 하셨는지요, 음식이 입에 맞으셨는지 모르겠네요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/001"
msgid "누가 대접한 식사인데 여부가 있겠습니까! 정말 잘 먹었습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/002"
msgid "그렇다면 다행이네요, 여러분께 조금이라도 만족을 드렸다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/003"
msgid "여유롭지 않은 상황인 걸로 알고 있는데, 각설하고 본론을 듣고 싶습니다만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/004"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/005"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/006"
msgid "앗.../30d /n저, 예..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/007"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/008"
msgid "시라노 님 말씀이 갑작스러워 부담을 드린 모양입니다만, 저희는 에스테도데 님을 한시라도 빨리 돕고 싶은 마음에서 드린 말씀이니 허물없이 고민을 말씀해 주십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/009"
msgid "아니예요, 조금 당황했지만 시라노 님 말씀이 맞는걸요.../n오히려 그렇게 말씀해 주시니 부담이 줄어드네요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/010"
msgid "그럼 여러분들을 모시게 된 바로 그 문제에 대해 말씀드리겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/011"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/012"
msgid "부끄러운 이야기입니다만 저희 리브레빌은 제국령에서 두번째로 살기 좋은 고장으로 평가 받고 있습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/013"
msgid "당연하죠! 아니 여기는 제국령 최고라고 해도 될 겁니다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/014"
msgid "리델!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/015"
msgid "윽......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/016"
msgid "선대 영주와 주민들은 산지를 개척하고 척박했던 땅을 깍아 도로를 건설했고, 결국은 북방의 비프로스트나 커티스와의 교역의 중심지로 자리 잡게 되었습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/017"
msgid "이 땅은 우리들의 피와 땀이 일구어낸 결실인 것입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/018"
msgid "그런데.... 일년 전이었을 겁니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/019"
msgid "커티스로 통하기 위한 이 마을의 동쪽 길./n바로 그 도로의 북쪽에 있는 고원 지대가 새로운 영지로 분리되어 마을이 들어서게 된거예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/020"
msgid "설마 영지가 분리된게 곤란하다는 말씀인가요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/021"
msgid "그런 건 신경쓰지 않아요. 문제는, 그 작은 마을이 우리 리브레빌의 생명이나 다름 없는 이 도로를 버젓이 자기들의 소유인냥 차지하고는 통행세를 받기 시작한 거죠. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/022"
msgid "정말 염치도 없는 녀석들이로군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/023"
msgid "하지만 제국령 내에서 그 정도 영토 분쟁은 여기저기서 셀 수도 없이 많이 벌어지고 있어요. 설마 이 정도일로 우리에게 도움을 청하려는 건 아니겠죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/024"
msgid "아직 말씀이 끝나지 않은 것 같은데 조금만 더 이야기를 들어보지요, 이자벨 님."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/025"
msgid "예, 사실 단지 통행세 정도의 문제 였으면 우리 영주들 선에서 해결을 보려고 했는데, 그 곳의 영주는 외부에 얼굴을 내비치지도 않을 뿐더러 우리쪽에서 서한을 보내도 소식이 없는 거예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/026"
msgid "게다가..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/027"
msgid "게다가...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/028"
msgid "그 도로를 통해 일을 하던 사람들이 언제부터인가 하나둘씩 리브레빌로 돌아오지 않는 거예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/029"
msgid "예?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/030"
msgid "실종?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/031"
msgid "납치라고 말씀하고 싶으신 겁니까."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/032"
msgid "저도 그렇게 까지는 생각하고 싶지 않았어요, 하지만 아무래도 우리 마을 사람들의 실종을 두손 놓고 보고만 있을 수는 없었어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/033"
msgid "하지만 어째서 직접 그들과 싸우지 않는 거죠? 리브레빌이 사람도 더 많고 더 발전된 마을이잖아요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/034"
msgid "그건... 우리들에게 힘이 없는 것도 이유중 하나지만 그들의 마을은 비 정상적이거든요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/035"
msgid "화력입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/036"
msgid "아.../30d 예... 화력뿐 아니라.. 그들은 몬스터를 이용하고 있어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/037"
msgid "몬스터를... 확실히 뭔가가 있군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/038"
msgid "얼굴을 드러내지 않고 몬스터를 부려 사람들을 납치하는 영주라.../40d 소설을 무척 좋아하는 영주인가 보군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/039"
msgid "우리가 어떻게 해주길 바라는 거죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/040"
msgid "당연히 이 창으로 그 녀석을 절단내길 바라는 말씀이겠지!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/041"
msgid "무고한 사람을 괴롭히는 녀석을 우리 제피르팰컨이 가만 둘 수 없지. 영주님의 청이 아니었다고 할지라도 이런 사실을 진작에 알았더라면 우리가 가만 있지 않았을 거요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/042"
msgid "그럼 제 청을 들어주시려나요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/043"
msgid "잠깐, 설마 아무런 대가도 없이 우리 힘을 빌리려는 생각은 아니겠죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/044"
msgid "물론 빈손으로 도움을 청한건 아니니까 안심하세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/045"
msgid "무슨 말씀을 하시는 겁니까, 영주님께 부담은..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/046"
msgid "옛말에 호의는 거절하는게 아니라고 했습니다. 무엇을 준비하셨는지 알고 싶습니다만, 에스테도데 님."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/047"
msgid "그리 대단한 것은 아니지만 제 정성을 선물 드리고 싶습니다. 세부적으로 말씀 드리자면"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/048"
msgid "연간 지원금 100만 엘드, 제 저택의 자유로운 사용과 제피르팰컨 간부들의 신분 보장을 약속 하겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/049"
msgid "100만을 매년...!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/050"
msgid "과연, 최고 영주님다운 배포이십니다./n감사히 받겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/051"
msgid "이번 일 뿐만이 아니라 저는 평소부터 제피르팰컨이 행하는 정의를 항상 동경해오고 있었답니다. 어떻게든 도움이 될 수 있다면 정성을 다 해 돕겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/052"
msgid "그리고 지금 당장 착수금으로 50만을 드리도록 할테니 유용하게 써주세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/053"
msgid "정말 고맙습니다, 에스테도데 영주님."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/054"
msgid "앞으로는 에스테라고 불러주세요, 메디치 님."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/055"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/056"
msgid "그리 대단한 것은 아니지만 제 정성이라고 생각하고 받아 주세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s05
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s05|@kfl10_s05/057"
msgid "/2c에스테도데 저택. 살롱."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/000"
msgid "인기척이...!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/001"
msgid "카나...!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/002"
msgid "[카나]/n메디치 오빠?/n안에 있어요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/003"
msgid "으응... 역시 아직 안왔나...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/004"
msgid "하긴, 메디치 오빠가 약속시간에 맞춰 나올리가 없지!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/005"
msgid "근데, 갑자기 이런 곳에서 무슨 볼일이 있다는 거지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/006"
msgid "아름다운 꽃 속에 둘러쌓이니 네 아름다움이 더욱 돋보이는구나, 카나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/007"
msgid "또 시작이군요, 메디치 오빠. /n그렇게 괜한 아첨 할 정도로 미안하면, 약속시간에 늦지나 말아요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/008"
msgid "아첨이라니, 너무하는군./n 난 카나에게는 언제나 진심이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/009"
msgid "계속 농담만하면 상대하지도 않을거예요./n장난은 그만두고 어서 본론이나 얘기해 봐요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/010"
msgid "네가 정 그렇게 내 말을 가볍게 듣는다면, 좋다./30d 나도 장난하듯이 얘기하지 않겠어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/011"
msgid "이제는 나도 너에 대한 태도를 확실히 하고 싶어, 카나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/012"
msgid "나의 마음을 받아다오, 카나. 나는 너를..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/013"
msgid "그만!/30d /n됐어요, 메디치 오빠./15d 더 이상 말하지 말아요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/014"
msgid "지금의 그 말은 듣지 않은 걸로 하겠어요. 다른 볼일이 없다면 돌아가겠어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/015"
msgid "카나!/30d 너는 아직도 내 마음을 모르는거야?/10d 이건 진심이야, 카나!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/016"
msgid "메디치 오빠의 마음은 알아요, 저도.../20d 저도 오빠를 좋아해요,/10d 존경하고.../10d 친오빠처럼 의지하고 있어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/017"
msgid "하지만... 하지만 연인이 될 수는 없다는 거냐?/30d 내게는 너의 사랑을 받을 자격이 없다는 말이냐...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/018"
msgid "그런게 아니예요./20d /n나는... 우리의 좋은 관계를 깨뜨리고 싶지 않아요./20d 우리모두의..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/019"
msgid "그리고 또.../20d 나는 다른 사람을 사랑하고 있어요./20d 비록... 그에게 인정받지는 못하고 있지만..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/020"
msgid "그 자로군..../30d /n시라노.../30d 그를 사랑한단 말이냐?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/021"
msgid "메디치 오빠, 제발 그만해요./30d 이런 일로 우리 사이에 불화를 일으킬 수는 없어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/022"
msgid "시라노 그 자의... 대체 어디가 그렇게 좋단 말이냐.../20d 그래 그렇군, 나보다.../10d 아니, 어느 누구보다도 강하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/023"
msgid "그래, 그런 것이였군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/024"
msgid "[카나]/n오빤 정말 바보야!/30d /n앞으로 메디치 오빠하고는 상대도 하지 않을 거예요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/025"
msgid "......."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/026"
msgid "카,...카나!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/027"
msgid "카나...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/028"
msgid "카나..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/029"
msgid "어머, 메디치 님 아니세요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/030"
msgid "에스테도데 님..!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/031"
msgid "꽃을 좋아하시나 봐요,/30d 이런 밤중에 까지 주무시지 않고 제 화원에 들리신 걸 보면."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/032"
msgid "아, 아예.. 좋아합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/033"
msgid "후후.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/034"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/035"
msgid "전 운이 좋은 모양이예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/036"
msgid "예?/30d 아../20d 저희가 도와드리러 온것 말씀하시는 거로군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/037"
msgid "그런게 아니예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/038"
msgid "?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/039"
msgid "사실 저는 매일 이 시간이면 이 화원에 들러 꽃들을 한번씩 둘러 보거든요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/040"
msgid "그런 제 습관 때문에 이렇게 밤중에 메디치 님 과 단 둘이서만 있을 수도 있게 되고.. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/041"
msgid "에, 에스테도데 님?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/042"
msgid "어머, 죄송해요./n기분 상하셨나요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/043"
msgid "아, 아니 기분 상하다니요./30d 에스테도데 님의 그 농담 덕분에 오히려 기분이 좋아졌는걸요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/044"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/045"
msgid "...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/046"
msgid ".../20d 농담이 아니예요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/047"
msgid "에엣?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/048"
msgid "동경해오고 있었어요. 저는... 메디치 님 당신을..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/049"
msgid "에스테도데 님... 나는.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/050"
msgid "알고 있어요.. 저를 가벼운 여자로 보시는 거죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/051"
msgid "그런.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/052"
msgid "그래요, 오늘 처음 뵌 분께 이런 고백을 하다니.. 우습게 보여도 어쩔 수 없겠죠."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/053"
msgid "하지만, 메디치 님./30d 이렇게 눈앞의 당신을 보니 제 자신을 주체 할 수 없었어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/054"
msgid "에스테도데 님... "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/055"
msgid "에스테..라고 불러주세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/056"
msgid "에스테... "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/057"
msgid "제 방까지... 에스코트는 해주시겠죠..?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s06
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s06|@kfl10_s06/058"
msgid "물론이오, 에스테."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/000"
msgid "/2c다음날 아침."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/001"
msgid "그럼, 시라노님은 안타나나리보로 가서 그곳 영주의 저택을 조사해 주시기 바랍니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/002"
msgid "다른 분들은 어디 다른 곳에 가신 모양이죠?/20d 모두 아침부터 보이질 않던데...?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/003"
msgid "아, 리델하트님과 이자벨님은 동부 도로쪽을 정찰 나가셨습니다만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/004"
msgid "카나님은 몸이 좋지 않다면서 방에서 나오시질 않으세요./30d 제가 좀 봐드린다고 해도..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/005"
msgid "몬스터 부리는 영주에게 겁이라도 먹은건가?/20d 웬 꾀병이람."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/006"
msgid "쓸데 없는 소리는 그만하고 어서 목적지로 향하자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/007"
msgid "예!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/008"
msgid "클라우제비츠, 그 괴 영주의 영지가 북동쪽 산 넘어 고원지대에 있다고 했던가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/009"
msgid "그렇습니다. 여기서 북동쪽, 비프로스트에 거의 접경해 있는 마을./20d 안타나나리보가 목적지 입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/010"
msgid "제가 조사한 바로는 그 영지 전체가 요새화 되어있으니 많은 주의가 필요할 듯 합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/011"
msgid "알겠소./15d /n그럼 다녀오도록 하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/000"
msgid "게이시르의 프레데릭 저택."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/001"
msgid "아직도 크리스티나의 소식은 들어오지 않았나요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/002"
msgid "음...아직은.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/003"
msgid "당신이야 말로 무사태평이군요. /n딸이 집을 나간지 석달이 지났는데도..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/004"
msgid "하하, 나도 그 나이때 세상을 돌아다니며 견문을 넓혔소. /n그녀석에게도 이번 여행이 좋은 경험이 될것이요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/005"
msgid "게다가, 그 아이는 나도 당해내지 못하는걸 당신도 잘 알지않소./n너무 걱정하지 않아도 될거요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/006"
msgid "그걸 지금 말씀이라고 하세요? /n그 애는 이제 겨우 열 다섯살이예요. /n더구나, 여자아이라고요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/007"
msgid "하지만, 그 녀석 심정도 이해가 되오. /n당신 말대로 겨우 열 다섯살인데 생판 모르는 사람에게 시집을 보내려 하다니.../n아무리 장인어른의 말씀이라 해도 이건 좀 어렵겠는걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/008"
msgid "그렇다고는 해도 집을 나가 버리다니.../n모두 당신이 어려서 부터 무술이나 가르키며 남자아이처럼 키운 탓이에요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/009"
msgid "하하! 걱정마오. /n그 녀석은 비록 여자아이라 해도 정말 대단한 성품과 재능을 타고 났어. /n어쩌면, 앞으로 프레데릭 가문을 빛낼 것은 이 알프레드 프레데릭이 아니라 바로 크리스티나 프레데릭이 될거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/010"
msgid "그런 말씀만 하지 마시고 제발 크리스티나를 찾아주세요. /15d /n당신이 직접 나서신다면 쉽게 찾으실 수 있잖아요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/011"
msgid "..당신이 그렇게까지 걱정을 하고 있는지는 몰랐구려. /n그렇다면 이번 기회에 찾으러 나서야 겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/012"
msgid "이번 기회라뇨?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/013"
msgid "실은 얼마전 장인어른께서 니코시아 지방에 설립하신 교회가 제피르팰컨에 의해 파괴당한 것 같소. /n또 반란이 일어나다니...내가 보기에도 장인어른이 너무 평민들을 윽박지른다는 생각이 드는걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/014"
msgid "여보.. 그 분은 저를 길러주신 분이세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/015"
msgid "미안하오. /n당신 때문만이라도 장인어른은 내게 정말로 고마우신 분이시지./n어찌되었든 제피르팰컨 녀석들도 요새는 너무 무서운것 없이 날뛰기 때문에 한번쯤 쓴맛을 보여주는 것도 좋겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/016"
msgid "그럼, 원정을 떠나실 계획인가요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/017"
msgid "일단, 각지를 돌아다니며 제피르녀석들을 상대하고 크리스티나의 소식을 탐문해 보도록 하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/018"
msgid "/2c게이시르. 프레데릭 저택."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl11_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl11_s01|@kfl11_s01/019"
