msgid "알고있다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/007"
msgid "......."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/008"
msgid "장군님, 어떻게 할까요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/009"
msgid "전군 전투태세에 들어간다! /n비프로스트군이 제국땅을 밟게 할 수는 없지..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/010"
msgid "출발은 내일 정오. /n일정에 차질이 없도록 철저히 준비해라."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/011"
msgid "알겠습니다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/012"
msgid "역시 장인어른이 마키아벨리를 비프로스트로 보낸 것은 이것 때문이었군.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/013"
msgid "그렇다고 하더라도 외세의 힘을 빌린다는것은 제국의 자존심에 관련된 일! /15d 이번일만은 절대로 용납될 수 없다! "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/014"
msgid "이번일만은 절대로 용납될 수 없다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/015"
msgid "문제는 비프로스트의 발키리 부대인데..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s01
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s01|@kfl13_s01/016"
msgid "우선 제피르팰컨의 클라우제비츠에게 전령을 보내야겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/000"
msgid "/2c게이시르 대성당. 체사레의 집무실"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/001"
msgid "....알겠습니다. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/002"
msgid "그점은 걱정하지 않으셔도 될겁니다. /n제가 알아서 하지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/003"
msgid "정보 주셔서 감사합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/004"
msgid "후후후. 프레데릭의 출병이라.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/005"
msgid "자, 그럼 프레데릭이 어느정도 버텨주는지 한번 볼까? /15d /n흥미로운걸... 쿡쿡쿡"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/006"
msgid "비프로스트군도 예상대로 움직여 주는군. /15d/n모든 것이 계획대로야.."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s02
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s02|@kfl13_s02/007"
msgid "당신이 세상을 뜬지도 어언 30년이 지났군....../n이제 우리의 한을 풀 순간이 점차 다가오고 있다오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/000"
msgid "식사는 잘 하셨는지요, 음식이 입에 맞으셨는지 모르겠네요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/001"
msgid "누가 대접한 식사인데 여부가 있겠습니까! 정말 잘 먹었습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/002"
msgid "그렇다면 다행이네요, 여러분께 조금이라도 만족을 드렸다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/003"
msgid "여유롭지 않은 상황인 걸로 알고 있는데, 각설하고 본론을 듣고 싶습니다만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=ko; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.ko_assets_all_6a1bcc61388aca28c75aef10ee7f439f.bundle; object=art_ko_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|ko|art_ko_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/004"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

