msgid "이런 네 모습을 보고 있으니/40d/n네 어머니 생각이 나는구나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/008"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/009"
msgid "아직은 시집 보낸것도 아닌데,/60d/n벌써 가슴이 이렇게 허전하다니…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/010"
msgid "허허…/40d 나도 이젠 정말 늙은 모양이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/011"
msgid "아버지,/35d 그런 말씀 하시지 마세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/012"
msgid "허허,/20d 추기경 어른도 참…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/013"
msgid "교회단의 명령이오!/35d/n악마 숭배 혐의로 기소된 시라노 번스타인은/35d 소환 명령에 따라/30d 지금 즉시 재판정에 동행을 요구하는 바이오!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/014"
msgid "뭐라고?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/015"
msgid "경,/20d 지금 뭐라고 하셨소./30d/n누가 악마 숭배 혐의로 기소되었다고?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/016"
msgid "번스타인 공,/20d 공의 아드님께서/20d 악마 숭배 혐의로/n기소되어 교회단에서 소환을 요청했습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s10
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s10|@kfl00_s10/017"
msgid "이런 중요한 때에/15d 대체 어딜 간 거지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/000"
msgid "게이시르 대성당, 악마재판장"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/001"
msgid "본 재판은/30d 피고/15d 시라노 번스타인의 악마 숭배 혐의를/35d/n조사,/15d 판결하기 위해 열린 재판입니다./45d/n현재 시각 8시로 개정하겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/002"
msgid "개정을 선포하는 바이오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/003"
msgid "본 교회는/30d 익명의 제보자로부터/35d/n피고의 악마 숭배 혐의를 제보받았다./50d/n그에 대해 인정하는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/004"
msgid "사실이 아닙니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/005"
msgid "피고는 지난 달 모일,/40d 악마의 금서를 탐독했다는데/45d/n그에 대해 인정하는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/006"
msgid "악마의 금서라니,/40d 전혀 모르는 사실입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/007"
msgid "피고는 위증을 하고 있소!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/008"
msgid "진정하시오./45d/n피고 자신이/15d 자신의 잘못을 모를 수도 있지 않소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/009"
msgid "/30d피고는/30d '창세전쟁의 비록'이라는 책에 대해/15d/n알고 있는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/010"
msgid "예,/25d 알고 있습니다./35d/n최근에 연구하고 있는 책입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/011"
msgid "맙소사…/30d 그런 일을…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/012"
msgid "'창세전쟁의 비록'은/30d 현자라 자칭했던/30d/n구 제국의 악마 기쉬네의 저서!/50d/n역시/20d 피고는 악마를 연구했던 것이로군!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/013"
msgid "그…/30d 그렇지 않습니다!/25d/n그 책은…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/014"
msgid "그 악마의 책을 연구했단 말인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/015"
msgid "그 책은 악마의 책이 아닙니다!/30d/n그건/20d 현자 기쉬네가 후세를 위해 기록한…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/016"
msgid "피고는/30d 악마의 사상을 받아들이려 했음이/30d/n틀림없군!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/017"
msgid "금서를…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/018"
msgid "악마의 책을…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/019"
msgid "악마다…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/020"
msgid "정숙하시오!/55d/n금서를 읽은 것은 큰 죄이지만,/50d 그것만으로/20d/n악마를 숭배했다는 혐의가 내려질 수는 없소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/021"
msgid "하지만,/25d 피고의 악마 숭배에 대한/15d/n결정적인 증인이 있습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/022"
msgid "증인…/20d 이라고?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/023"
msgid "증인 출두를 요청합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/024"
msgid "루벤?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/025"
msgid "저는,/25d 시라노 번스타인의/25d 권유를 받았습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/026"
msgid "권유?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/027"
msgid "그 책을 권하면서,/30d 악마의 가르침에 대해/30d 깊이 알아가도록…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/028"
msgid "루벤!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/029"
msgid "증인은/25d 피고와 친분이 깊은가보군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/030"
msgid "형제나/10d 다름 없습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/031"
msgid "어째서…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/032"
msgid "퇴정해도 좋소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/033"
msgid "…/40d그는 학술원 내에서도…/45d 악마 숭배의 의식을…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/034"
msgid "두려웠습니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/035"
msgid "그만해…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/036"
msgid "이스카리옷…/30d 무슨 소리야…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/037"
msgid "이런 일을 벌이는 사람을 그냥 두었다가는…/50d/n무슨 일이 일어날지…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s11
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s11|@kfl00_s11/038"
msgid "그만두란 말이야!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/000"
msgid "게이시르 대광장"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/001"
msgid "엄마,/15d 저 사람은 왜 저런 데 있어요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/002"
msgid "저 사람은/10d 아주 무서운 사람이에요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/003"
msgid "엄마,/20d 무서워요…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/004"
msgid "다시는/15d 저런 사람하고 이야기도 하면 안돼요,/20d/n알았지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/005"
msgid "이상하네,/30d/n얼마전에 저 오빠가 사탕도 주고 그랬는데."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/006"
msgid "뭐라고?!/25d/n왜 엄마한테 그런 이야기를 하지 않았니!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl00_s12|@kfl00_s12/007"
msgid "저 사람은/10d 착한 아이를 데려가서 잡아먹는/20d/n무서운 악마같은 사람이야!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl00_s12
