#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/020"
msgid "그래,/20d 귀족인 주제에 악마를 숭배하다/30d/n애인에게 버림받은 얼간이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/021"
msgid "그 애인은 한 달도 안 되어서/25d/n다른 남자와 결혼했다며?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/022"
msgid "그것도 상대가 프레데릭 경이라니./45d/n그 여자도 보통이 아닌걸?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/023"
msgid "이봐, 말 조심하라구./35d/n그래도 추기경 각하의 따님이란 말이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/024"
msgid "지금…/60d 뭐라고 했지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/025"
msgid "아,/25d 이 악마의 사제님은 아무것도 모르는 모양이구만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/026"
msgid "네가 사랑하는 약혼자는/35d 벌써 프레데릭 경과/n결혼을 해버렸다는 말이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/027"
msgid "약혼자가 감옥에 처박히자마자/50d/n다른 남자에게 청혼을 하다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/028"
msgid "그 프레데릭 경은/25d 엄청난 재력과/n권력을 가졌다고 하던데…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/029"
msgid "추기경의 딸도 별 수 없구만./50d 쯧쯧…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/030"
msgid "……!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/031"
msgid "그나저나,/30d 이 녀석은 유황굴로 옮긴다더군?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/032"
msgid "이봐,/35d 그 지옥으로 가는 것보다는/30d/n이 자리에서 혀라도 깨물고 자결하는 게 속 편할거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/033"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s01|@kfl02_s01/034"
msgid "이 친구야,/20d 지금 이러고 있을 때가 아니야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s01
