msgid "그 녀석,/25d 죽어버렸나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s03|@kfl02_s03/028"
msgid "죽었으면 썩기 전에 빨리 치워버려."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s03|@kfl02_s03/029"
msgid "제길…/25d 더럽군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s03|@kfl02_s03/030"
msgid "그런 것 같은데."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s03|@kfl02_s03/031"
msgid "[간수]/n이제야 왔나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s03|@kfl02_s03/032"
msgid "[간수]/n우물쭈물하지 말고 네놈도 빨리 유황굴로 기어들어가!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s03|@kfl02_s03/037"
msgid "[죄수]/n더 이상은…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/000"
msgid "이건…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/001"
msgid "[????]/n…목숨이 붙어 있는 인간이/30d 이곳에 오는 것은…/35d/n무척 오랜만이군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/002"
msgid "…/30d살아…/20d 있어?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/003"
msgid "[????]/n애석하지만 그런 것 같군./60d/n보아하니 자네는/20d 녀석들의 수하는 아닌 것 같은데…/55d/n여기는 어떻게 들어왔는가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/004"
msgid "당신은/15d 누굽니까?/45d 그리고 녀석들이라니…/45d/n주신교회 세력을 말하는 겁니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/005"
msgid "[데이모스]/n내 이름은 데이모스./45d/n주신교회라는 것은 알지 못한다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/006"
msgid "당신은/45d 이곳에 갇힌지 오래된 것 같군요./60d/n제국령 전역에 위세를 떨치고 있는 주신교를 모른다니…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/007"
msgid "그나저나/40d 데이모스라…/50d/n들어본 적 있는 이름인데…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/008"
msgid "[데이모스]/n자네는 그 세력에 대항하다/30d 이런 모습이 된 것인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/009"
msgid "대항이라도 했다면 억울하지도 않을 겁니다./65d/n교회 세력의 수장이라 할 수 있는 체사레 추기경은,/65d/n내 약혼녀의 아버지였단 말입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/010"
msgid "[데이모스]/n그렇다면 그 추기경에게/30d/n크게 해가 될 일이라도 한 모양이로군…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/011"
msgid "아닙니다!/45d/n저는 단지,/35d 역사의 진실에 대해 연구하려 했을 뿐입니다./50d/n그게 어째서 교회에 해가 된단 말입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/012"
msgid "[데이모스]/n진실에는/20d 항상 고통이 따르는 법이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/013"
msgid "[데이모스]/n역사의 진실이라…/50d/n자네는/20d 어떤 진실을 밝히려 했다는 말인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/014"
msgid "그저/45d 창세전쟁의 비록이라는/30d/n구 제국 현자의 역사서를 연구했을 뿐입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/015"
msgid "[데이모스]/n흐음…/20d 자네가 창세전쟁을 연구했다고?/60d/n그렇다면 나에 대해서도 알고 있을지도 모르겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/016"
msgid "당신을…?/45d 그건/15d 대체 무슨…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/017"
msgid "!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/018"
msgid "데이모스…/45d/n데이모스라면…/45d 설마…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/019"
msgid "암흑신의 수장/40d 데이모스?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/020"
msgid "[데이모스]/n후후,/40d 이미 옛날 얘기지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/021"
msgid "당신이 정말/30d 암흑신 데이모스란 말입니까?/60d/n이럴수가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/022"
msgid "역시/45d 창세전쟁의 비록은 거짓이 아니었어!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/023"
msgid "[데이모스]/n그런 것보다,/30d 아까 자네가 하던 얘기를 마저 듣고 싶군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/024"
msgid "제…/30d 이야기를 말입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s04|@kfl02_s04/025"
msgid "[데이모스]/n이런…/15d 시간이 된 것 같군./40d/n다시 보게 되면/20d 자네 이야기를 자세히 해주지 않겠나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/000"
msgid "인페르노 지하감옥"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/001"
msgid "데이모스라… "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/002"
msgid "어째서/40d 암흑신의 수장인 데이모스가/40d/n이 인페르노 지하에 있는 걸까…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/003"
msgid "신의 힘을 무력화할 수 있을 정도의/40d/n암흑 결계술을 펼칠 수 있는 인간이 있단 말인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/004"
msgid "…/35d인간?/35d 아니야,/20d 인간이 아닐지도…/45d/n그러고 보니/30d 창세전쟁 이후에도 살아남은 신이/45d/n있지 않았던가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/005"
msgid "[시라노]/n……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/006"
msgid "휴,/55d 더 이상은 기억나지 않는군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/007"
msgid "다행히 간수들은/15d 그의 존재를 모르는 것 같으니,/50d/n기회를 봐서 다시 한번 그를 만나봐야…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/008"
msgid "크윽…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/009"
msgid "[시라노]/n쿨럭…/30d 쿨럭…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/010"
msgid "제길…/50d 아무래도 내게 남은 시간은,/45d/n얼마 되지 않는 것 같군…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s05|@kfl02_s05/011"
msgid "내일…/60d 내일 다시 그가 있는 장소로 가 보자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/000"
msgid "데이모스 님,/35d 안녕하셨습니까."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/001"
msgid "[데이모스]/n왔는가…/30d 자네를 기다리고 있었다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/002"
msgid "지난번에 제게 말씀하신 일도 있고,/50d/n데이모스 님의 일도…/40d/n궁금한 점이 있어서/30d 몇 가지 여쭈러 왔습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/003"
msgid "[데이모스]/n궁금한 점?/40d 그래,/30d 한 번 말해보게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/004"
msgid "예,/35d 창세전쟁의 비록에 따르면…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/005"
msgid "나는 먼저/30d 데이모스에게 창세전쟁의 진위를 확인하듯이 물었다./60d/n희미해진 지식을 다시 정리할 필요가 있었기 때문이다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/006"
msgid "…지금으로부터 약 반세기 전,/45d 가슴에 검은 야망을 품은 인물이 있었다./50d/n과거 게이시르 제국의 재상,/30d 베라딘."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/007"
msgid "베라딘은/15d 게이시르 제국 황태자인 흑태자와 절친이었고,/50d/n이를 이용해 야망을 실현시키고자 했다./75d/n그런데/25d 이런 그의 야망을 깨뜨린 인물은/35d 공교롭게도 흑태자 칼 스타이너였다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/008"
msgid "그리고/15d 팬드래건 왕국의 국왕 라시드 팬드래건 또한/50d/n흑태자를 도와 베라딘의 음모를 파훼하였다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/009"
msgid "팬드래건을 중심으로 구성된/20d 아스타니아,/20d 다갈,/20d 커티스의/30d 동부 4개국 연맹인 실버애로우와/60d/n게이시르,/20d 트리시스,/20d 가라드로 이뤄진/20d 서부 3개국 연맹 다크아머."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/010"
msgid "실버애로우와 다크아머의 깃발 아래,/40d/n두 영웅은/20d 신들과 목숨을 건 전쟁을 벌였고,/45d/n결국 안타리아를 지켜낸다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/011"
msgid "그것이/15d 창세전쟁…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/012"
msgid "그리고 나는/20d 암흑신 데이모스가 재차 봉인당하게 된 과정과/55d 그 일을 주도한 인물들,/40d/n그리고/20d 이유에 대한 궁금증을 하나씩 풀어가기 시작했다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/013"
msgid "그러면서 알게 된 것은,/30d 창세전쟁 이후 살아남은 암흑신,/40d/n즉/15d 파멸의 유스타시아와/30d 달의 디아블로가/30d/n어떤 계획을 진행시키기 위해 데이모스를 봉인시켰다는 사실이었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/014"
msgid "하지만/15d 그 계획이 무엇인지 알 수 없었다./40d/n단지,/15d 인류에게 좋은 일은 아닐 거라 추측할 뿐."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/015"
msgid "데이모스는/15d 그의 과거를 이야기하는 것보다는/25d 나의 이야기를 듣고 싶어 했다./40d/n하지만/20d 나는 전혀 즐겁지 않았다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/016"
msgid "과거의 일을 떠올릴 때마다 끓어오르는 강렬한 분노,/60d/n그리고/20d 마지막에는 으레 나를 덮쳐오는 절망감…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/017"
msgid "메르세데스와의 갑작스러운 이별에 대한/15d 진실을 알고 싶다는 마음이 강해질수록,/60d/n지옥과 같은 이곳에서/30d 벗어날 수 없는 현실을 깨닫기 때문이었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/018"
msgid "…/45d제게는 고통뿐인 과거입니다./55d/n기억조차 하고 싶지 않은 지독한 고통들…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/019"
msgid "[데이모스]/n고통을 피하기 위해/20d 진실을 외면하겠다는 것인가?/50d/n하지만/30d 고통과 마주해야 깨닫게 되는 진실도 있는 법이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/020"
msgid "알려주십시오,/10d 데이모스 님./40d/n저는/35d 이제 아무것도 모르겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/021"
msgid "선이/40d 반드시 빛 아래에 있는 것은 아님은 알았습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/022"
msgid "하지만…/35d 더는 모르겠습니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/023"
msgid "[데이모스]/n무엇이 선이고/30d 무엇이 악인가…/40d/n변화해가는 이 세상에서/25d 올바른 답을 찾기란/25d/n쉬운 일은 아니겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/024"
msgid "[데이모스]/n그러나/25d 자네가 계속 찾아간다면,/35d/n변하지 않고 그 손에 남아있는 것이 있을 거라네./60d/n그리고/30d 그것은 진실로 이어질 터…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/025"
msgid "[데이모스]/n그러기 위해서는/25d 먼저 마음의 고통을 이겨내는 것./35d/n거기에서부터 시작일세."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/026"
msgid "[데이모스]/n자네가 외면해온 상처를 더듬어 보게나./50d/n가장 아름다웠던 추억을 시작으로,/50d 한가닥 실타래 끝을/n풀어가듯 따라가면,/50d 무엇인가가 보일 것이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s06
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s06|@kfl02_s06/027"
msgid "…/45d메르…/15d세데스…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/000"
msgid "인페르노 지하감옥"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/001"
msgid "나를 나락으로 떨어뜨린 인물이라면…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/002"
msgid "내가/20d '창세전쟁'에 대해 연구하는 것을/20d/n두고 볼 수 없었던 자의 소행이라 짐작할 수 있었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/003"
msgid "데이모스의 말에 따르면,/30d/n창세전쟁 당시 사용된/25d 궁극의 힘을 얻고자 하는 이가 있었을 것이라고 한다./60d/n아마…/30d 그 자가 나를 감옥에 넣음으로써/35d 그 힘이 세상에 알려지는 것을 막은 것이리라."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/004"
msgid "나에게 있어서/20d '창세전쟁의 비록'은/40d 단지 오래된 싸움의 기록일 뿐이었지만,/60d/n그 내용이 알려지면/25d 곤란한 누군가가 있다는 말인가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/005"
msgid "루벤…?/30d 아니…/30d 이스카리옷…?/30d 아니면/20d 제국학술원의 누군가…?/60d/n지금의 나로서는/30d 그것을 확인할 방법은 없다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/006"
msgid "데이모스는/30d 내가 누명을 쓴 이유에 대해 분석해 주었을 뿐 아니라/40d/n역사학과 논리적 추론법 등/30d 많은 지식을 전수해 주었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/007"
msgid "데이모스의 존재,/40d 그리고/20d 메르세데스에 대한 집념./45d/n그 두 가지가/20d 이 지옥같은 생활을 버텨낼 수 있게 해주었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/008"
msgid "하지만/30d 데이모스를 알게된 지 1년이 지난 어느 날./40d/n나의 육신은 한계에 이르렀고,/45d 죽음을 눈 앞에 두고 있었다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/009"
msgid "으윽…/30d 가…/20d 가슴이…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/010"
msgid "아…/25d 안돼…/35d/n여기서…/45d 쓰러질/20d 수…는…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/011"
msgid "[시라노]/n으윽…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/012"
msgid "…/30d메르…/40d세데스…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/013"
msgid "[간수]/n어이…/15d 이리 좀 와 봐."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/014"
msgid "[간수]/n무슨일이야?/40d 음?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/015"
msgid "[간수]/n이봐!/25d 작업 시간이다./30d/n어서 일어나!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/016"
msgid "[간수]/n…이 녀석,/20d 죽었나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/017"
msgid "[간수]/n그런 것 같은데?/40d/n꿈쩍도 하지 않는군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/018"
msgid "[간수]/n질긴 놈이야./30d 4년 씩이나 버티다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/019"
msgid "[간수]/n시체나 빨리 치워버리자고."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/020"
msgid "[간수]/n응…?/30d/n이 녀석…/20d 아직 목숨이 붙어있는데,/30d 어쩌지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/021"
msgid "[간수]/n어쩌긴./30d 귀찮으니 그냥 처리해버려./40d/n그 왜,/20d 작년에 지진으로 새로 생긴 구덩이 있잖아."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s07|@kfl02_s07/022"
msgid "[간수]/n왜 나한테 하라는 거야./15d 귀찮게…/10d/n쯧…/25d 그럼 자네도 좀 도와달라구."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/000"
msgid "[데이모스]/n시라노여…/20d 눈을 뜨게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/001"
msgid "[데이모스]/n오늘은 자네가 죽을 날이 아니야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/002"
msgid "…/55d데…/25d 데이…/20d모스…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/003"
msgid "[데이모스]/n다행이야./35d 아직 늦지 않았군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/004"
msgid "…/40d죽기 전에…/55d 마지막 인사는/25d 드릴 수 있어…/75d/n다행입니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/005"
msgid "[데이모스]/n약한 소리 하지 말게./35d/n자네는 아직 죽어선 안 돼."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/006"
msgid "…하지만…/45d 이제는…/65d/n몸을/20d 움직일 수…/25d조차…/60d 없습니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/007"
msgid "[데이모스]/n걱정하지 말게."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/008"
msgid "[데이모스]/n나에게 남은 마지막 힘…/45d/n영혼의 힘을/30d 자네에게 주겠네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/009"
msgid "무…/50d 무슨…/30d 말씀을…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/010"
msgid "[데이모스]/n내가 지니고 있던/20d 모든 생체의 힘은,/45d/n예전에/15d 흑태자에게 주었지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/011"
msgid "[데이모스]/n이 육신은/15d 빈 껍데기나 마찬가지지만,/40d/n아직/15d 영혼의 힘은 남아있다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/012"
msgid "설…/25d마…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/013"
msgid "[데이모스]/n그 힘이라면/25d 자네의 생명을 이어주는 일 정도는/35d/n어렵지 않을거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/014"
msgid "그런…/40d 안됩니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/015"
msgid "데이모스…/45d 당신은/25d 신…/65d/n나 같은/10d 인간의 생명을/20d 위해서…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/016"
msgid "[데이모스]/n그런 소리 말게./45d 오랜 시간동안/25d 무력과 적막의/10d/n고통에 시달리던 나에게/30d 말을 걸어 준 것은,/25d/n시라노 자네뿐이지 않나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/017"
msgid "[데이모스]/n나의 피와/15d 지식을 이어받은 자네는/35d/n내 자식이나 다를 바 없지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/018"
msgid "[데이모스]/n지금까지/10d 많은 생명을 창조했지만,/40d/n그 중에서도/25d 나의 아들이라고 할 수 있는 것은/25d/n단 두 사람."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/019"
msgid "[데이모스]/n흑태자/20d 칼 스타이너와,/25d/n그리고/30d 시라노/25d 자네뿐이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/020"
msgid "하지만…/50d 하찮은 이 생명을/20d 유지하기 위해…/55d/n당신의 생명을/20d 받을 수는/15d 없습니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/021"
msgid "그런 말씀…/35d 마시고…/55d/n이 지옥으로부터/25d 벗어날/20d 영혼의/35d 해방을…/40d/n축복해/20d 주십시오…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/022"
msgid "[데이모스]/n시라노여,/25d 내 말을 잘 듣게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/023"
msgid "[데이모스]/n나의 힘은/15d 칼 스타이너에게,/35d/n그리고/15d 나의 영혼은/30d 시라노/15d 자네에게 물려주겠네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/024"
msgid "[데이모스]/n자네는 칼이 남긴 검을 찾아/50d 그 힘을 거두어 주게나./45d/n그 검은/30d 이 세상을 지키기 위해 필요한 힘."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/025"
msgid "[데이모스]/n어디에 어떻게 쓰는지는/30d 자네 선택에 달려있지./50d/n하지만/30d 자네의 뜻이/30d 곧 내 뜻이니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/026"
msgid "데이모스 님…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/027"
msgid "[데이모스]/n나의 영혼은/40d 영원히/25d 자네와 함께 있을 거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/028"
msgid "흑태자 칼 스타이너가 남긴 힘은, 대륙 남단의 폭풍도라는 섬에 묻혀있네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s08
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s08|@kfl02_s08/029"
msgid "폭풍도의 아수라!/15d 아수라를 잊지 말게!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s09
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s09|@kfl02_s09/000"
msgid "감옥 안에서 정신을 차린 나는,/40d 꿈이라도 꾼 기분이었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s09
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s09|@kfl02_s09/001"
msgid "수년간 나를 괴롭혔던 고통이/30d 씻은 듯이 사라졌을 뿐 아니라,/40d/n유황의 기운이/20d 오히려 나에게 힘을 주는 듯 했다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s09
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s09|@kfl02_s09/002"
msgid "무엇보다도,/25d/n어디에서 무엇을 하든/20d 데이모스의 영혼이 나를 지켜줄 거라 생각하니/45d/n정신적으로 큰 힘이 되었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s09
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s09|@kfl02_s09/003"
msgid "그리고 그 날…/40d/n그의 도움이 없었더라면/35d 나는 아직까지도/20d 그 지옥을/20d 헤매고 있었겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s09
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s09|@kfl02_s09/004"
msgid "시간이 없다,/15d 서둘러라!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl02_s09
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl02_s09|@kfl02_s09/005"
msgid "그리고 나는 지금…/60d/n데이모스가 말한 힘을 얻기 위한 여정을/45d 막/25d 시작하려 하고 있었다."
msgstr ""

