#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl05_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl05_s01|@kfl05_s01/009"
msgid "흑태자는/15d 최후의 순간/35d '아수라파천무'를 능가하는/30d/n새로운 경지에 도달했었지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl05_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl05_s01|@kfl05_s01/010"
msgid "자네도/30d 그런 경지에 다다를 수 있을 지는/25d 의문이군."
