msgctxt "field|re|art_fl05_s2b|@kfl05_s2b/000"
msgid "갑판으로 올라가서 상황을 한번 살펴보는 게 좋겠는걸."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/000"
msgid "드디어 제국령에 도착했군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/001"
msgid "게이시르 시티로/15d 바로 가실 생각이신가요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/002"
msgid "우선은/25d 내가 제국을 떠나있던 동안 무슨 일이 있었는지 알아봐야겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/003"
msgid "기억으로는/25d 이곳은 카라카스 지방이었을 텐데…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/004"
msgid "엇,/10d 저기…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/005"
msgid "후후후,/25d 보기 좋게 걸려들었군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/006"
msgid "제피르 팰컨의/20d 카나 밀라노비치라니,/40d/n생각보다 큰 수확이군!/65d/n순순히 투항하시지! "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/007"
msgid "[??]/n아차,/30d 역시 함정이었네!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/008"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/009"
msgid "앗!/20d 어이~/15d 여기예요,/10d 여기!/20d/n빨리빨리!/15d 이 녀석들의 옆을 쳐요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/010"
msgid "아니!/15d 저 쪽에도 일당이 있다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/011"
msgid "놈들을 놓치지 마라!/40d 일망타진하는 거다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/012"
msgid "뭐야,/10d 저 아가씨는!/35d/n아무 상관 없는 사람을 멋대로 끌어들여?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/013"
msgid "저들에게 모르는 사이라 말해도 통하지 않을 것 같군./60d/n길을 막는다면/35d 굳이 피할 필요는 없겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/014"
msgid "갑자기 미안해요!/25d 괜찮아요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/015"
msgid "아무 상관 없는 사람을 휘말리게 하다니,/35d 너무한 거 아니야?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/016"
msgid "미안!/20d 진짜 도와줘서 고마워요!/25d/n근데/10d 지금 너무 바빠서!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/017"
msgid "인사는 다음에!/20d 그럼 이만! "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/018"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/019"
msgid "하!/35d 정말 무례한 아가씨네!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/020"
msgid "훗,/45d 고향으로 돌아온 인사라고 생각하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/021"
msgid "이 근처에 마을이 있을 거야./40d/n오늘은 그곳에서 묵도록 하지. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/022"
msgid "[??]/n!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/023"
msgid "[??]/n아~/10d 진짜!/25d 매복에 걸리다니!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/024"
msgid "제국령, 카라카스 지방"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/025"
msgid "제 6 장"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s01|@kfl06_s01/026"
msgid "제피르 팰컨"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/000"
msgid "카라카스 영주인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/001"
msgid "[병사]/n영주님의 행차시다!/35d 길을 비켜라!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/002"
msgid "[마을 주민]/n쳇…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/003"
msgid "설마…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/004"
msgid "아는 사람인가요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/005"
msgid "죽어서도 잊지 못할 얼굴이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/006"
msgid "외지에서 오신 분이신가 보군요./80d/n저 유명한 루벤 번스타인 공작을 모르시다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/007"
msgid "실례지만/35d 방금 마차에 탄 사람은 누구입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/008"
msgid "실버,/30d 마차의 뒤를 쫓자!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/009"
msgid "루벤의 뒤를 쫓겠습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/010"
msgid "아니야, 조금 더 상황을 보자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/011"
msgid "시라노,/25d 마차를 쫓기에는 늦은 거 같아요./20d/n어디로 갔는지 보이지 않는걸요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/012"
msgid "제길…/40d 어쩔 수 없군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/013"
msgid "내일 화형식이 있다고 했으니,/40d 그때 기회를 살펴야겠군./70d/n일단/20d 오늘 묵을 곳을 찾아보자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/014"
msgid "유명하다고?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/015"
msgid "잔혹하기로 유명한 영주죠./50d 이곳에 온 것도/30d/n내일 있을 화형식을 집행하기 위해서라구요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/016"
msgid "루벤 번스타인…?!/50d 놈이 공작?/40d/n그것도 모자라/20d 번스타인의 이름을 쓰고 있다고? "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/020"
msgid "루벤?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/021"
msgid "차라리/15d 내일 화형식을 기다리는 게 어때요?/30d/n영주도 온다고 했으니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s02|@kfl06_s02/022"
msgid "실버, 마차의 뒤를 쫓자!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/000"
msgid "도대체 데이빗이 무슨 죄를 졌다고…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/001"
msgid "제피르 팰컨 사람들을 도와준 것이 화근이지 뭐."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/002"
msgid "제길,/30d 제피르 팰컨한테 뺨맞고/30d 우리에게 화풀이군 그래!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/003"
msgid "쉿!/40d 누가 들으면 어쩌려고 그래?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/004"
msgid "우리 마을에도/20d 제피르 팰컨이 와주었으면…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/005"
msgid "제피르 팰컨이라…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/006"
msgid "제피르 팰컨이라면,/60d/n몇 년 전부터 제국령에 출몰하는 반란군으로/30d 최근 유명해진 것 같더군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/007"
msgid "…오랜만에 듣는 이름이군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/008"
msgid "루벤 공작님께서 납신다!/40d 모두 정숙하도록!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/009"
msgid "루벤…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/010"
msgid "시라노,/15d 지금 칠까요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/011"
msgid "어떻게 하겠습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/012"
msgid "좋아, 실버. 정면 돌파다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/013"
msgid "아직이야. 상황을 보자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/014"
msgid "어리석은 녀석,/35d 반란군에 동조하다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/015"
msgid "이런 대역죄는/25d 절대 용서할 수 없다!/35d/n극형으로 다스려 국법의 무서움을 보여줘야 한다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/016"
msgid "루벤 공작님,/30d 화형식 준비를 마쳤습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/017"
msgid "좋아./25d 지금이다, 실버./20d 정면 돌파다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/018"
msgid "아직은 안돼./45d/n화형식이 시작되고/35d 놈이 경계를 풀 때까지 기다리자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/019"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/020"
msgid "식을 멈춰라,/15d 루벤!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/021"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/022"
msgid "무고한 사람들을 괴롭히는 악덕 영주!/45d/n루벤 공작,/25d 제피르 팰컨이 당신의 횡포를 두고만 볼 줄 알았어?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/023"
msgid "제피르 팰컨이다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/024"
msgid "영주를 처단하라!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/025"
msgid "제피르 팰컨,/n우리를 도와줘요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/026"
msgid "뭣들 하는 거냐!/40d 놈들을 막아라!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/027"
msgid "맙소사,/25d 또 저 아가씨야?/50d/n그러고 보니,/20d 어제 마주쳤을 때/20d 제피르 팰컨의 카나라고 했던가."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/028"
msgid "선수를 놓쳤군./40d/n뭐,/10d 좋아./25d 간다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s03|@kfl06_s03/029"
msgid "다음날, 화형식장"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/000"
msgid "뭐…/10d 뭐야?/20d 웬 놈들이냐!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/001"
msgid "흥!/25d 죄 없는 백성들을 괴롭히는 악덕 영주,/40d 루벤 공작!/25d/n너를 심판하기 위해/20d 제피르 팰컨이 왔다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/002"
msgid "경비병,/15d 경비병!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/003"
msgid "하하!/35d 경비병이 아직 남아 있을 것 같아?/40d/n이미 이 근방의 경비병은 모두 처리했다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/004"
msgid "으윽…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/005"
msgid "…/40d이상하군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/006"
msgid "네?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/007"
msgid "역시나…/45d 속았다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/008"
msgid "속았다니요…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/009"
msgid "이 자는 루벤이 아니야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/010"
msgid "설마…/30d 가짜란 말?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/011"
msgid "그 말대로지./40d/n이 자는 허수아비일 뿐이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/012"
msgid "하지만,/25d 어떻게 알아볼 수가 있죠?/30d 아무리 봐도 루벤인데 말이에요./45d/n…조금 떨고 있는 것 같긴 하지만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/013"
msgid "절대 아니야./50d/n다른 사람은 몰라도/25d 나는 속일 수 없어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/014"
msgid "실버,/35d 여기서 더 볼일은 없어./35d/n놈을 쫓는다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/015"
msgid "어디로 도망쳤는지/25d 짐작가는 곳이 있으신가요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/016"
msgid "자신의 영지를 두고 멀리 도망칠 리는 없겠지./55d/n분명/20d 근방의 영주에게 도움을 청하러 갔을 거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/017"
msgid "맞는 말이야!/15d/n자,/10d 어서 쫓아가죠!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/018"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/019"
msgid "??"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/020"
msgid "지금부터는/15d 제피르 팰컨과는 상관없는 일이지 않나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/021"
msgid "루벤이 영지를 버리고 도망쳤으니/50d 이미 목적은 달성했을 텐데?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/022"
msgid "그야…/15d 그렇지만…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/023"
msgid "이제 같이 행동할 이유는 없으니,/45d 여기까지로 하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/024"
msgid "네?/20d/n그래도/15d 여기까지 왔으니/15d 진짜를 같이 쫓으러…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/025"
msgid "그럼/10d 이만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/026"
msgid "자, 잠깐!/15d 잠깐만요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/027"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/028"
msgid "……쳇."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/029"
msgid "알았다구요./30d 어딜가든지 마음대로 하세요./40d/n우리 제피르 팰컨이랑 상관 없는 일이니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/030"
msgid "아~"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/031"
msgid "[루밴]/n저기…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/032"
msgid "가짜 아저씨는 또 뭐예요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/033"
msgid "[루밴]/n아니…/10d 그…/10d 그러니까…/20d/n저는/15d 어떻게 하면…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/034"
msgid "거슬리게 눈앞에서 얼쩡거리지 말고/30d/n빨리 집에나 가요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/035"
msgid "[루밴]/n그…/15d 그럼/30d 가보겠습니다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/036"
msgid "그래…/30d 제피르 팰컨과는/20d 상관없다는 거지…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/037"
msgid "빨리 놈들을/20d 체…/10d 체포하라!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s04|@kfl06_s04/038"
msgid "??"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/000"
msgid "이런,/35d 경비병을 상대하는 사이에 도망쳤나…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/001"
msgid "아쉽게 놓쳐버렸네요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/002"
msgid "할 수 없지./35d/n저택으로 몸을 피했을 테니/25d 그쪽으로 간다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/003"
msgid "공작의 저택에 정면으로 쳐들어 가는 건/30d 좋지 못한 생각이에요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/004"
msgid "흥,/30d 설마 경비병이 지키고 있으니까…/20d/n같은/15d 당연한 소리를 하려는 건 아니겠지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/005"
msgid "뭐~/15d 그쪽 실력이면/20d 경비병쯤은 별거 아니겠죠./35d/n하지만/15d 경비병을 상대하는 동안/15d 공작은 또 도망가 버리지 않겠어요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/006"
msgid "그래서,/30d 아가씨가 원하는 건 뭐지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/007"
msgid "우리 정보원이/15d 저택으로 통하는/10d/n비밀 통로를 발견했어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/008"
msgid "그쪽을 통해 몰래 들어가면/35d/n루벤 공작이 도망갈 틈도 없을 거예요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/009"
msgid "지금은 서로 목적이 같으니까,/35d/n우리 일에 협조한다면/15d 비밀 통로를 알려드리죠."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/010"
msgid "어려울 건 없지./45d/n그럼/15d 안내를 부탁하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/011"
msgid "좋아요!/15d 이쪽이에요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/012"
msgid "이 나무를 빠져나가 뒤로 돌아가면/25d 하수구가 있어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/013"
msgid "[카나]/n잠깐만요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/014"
msgid "헤헷,/30d 이제야 말이 좀 통하는군요! "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_s05|@kfl06_s05/015"
msgid "단,/15d 함께 행동하는 조건으로!/30d/n어때요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/000"
msgid "드디어 제국령에 도착했군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/001"
msgid "이제 어떻게 하실 생각이시죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/002"
msgid "내가 떠난 이후 바뀐 제국의 사정에 관해 여러가지 알아봐야겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/003"
msgid "기억으로는 이곳은 카라카스 지방일텐데..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/004"
msgid "앗, 저기...!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/005"
msgid "후후후, 기다리고 있었다. 카나 밀라노비치!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/006"
msgid "제피르 팰컨의 부대장이라니 생각보다 큰 수확인걸!/30d 이제는 순순히 투항하시지!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/007"
msgid "이런, 역시 함정이었나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/008"
msgid "하지만 공작의 영지로 가는 길은 이곳뿐인데..."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/009"
msgid "엇! 어이 여기예요, 여기! 이 녀석들의 옆을 쳐요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/010"
msgid "아니, 저 쪽에도 일당이 있다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/011"
msgid "좋아, 녀석들도 놓치지 말고 일망타진 하자!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/012"
msgid "뭐야, 저 아가씨는!/20d 멀쩡한 사람을 끌어 들이다니!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/013"
msgid "훗, 저 아가씨 함부로 위험한 짓을.../20d 하지만 병사들이 길을 막는다면 굳이 피할 것까지는 없겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/014"
msgid "미안해요, 갑자기 끌어들여서."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/015"
msgid "흥, 차라리 칼 꽂고서 미안하다고 하시지!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/016"
msgid "이것으로 병사들은 모두 해치운 셈인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/017"
msgid "도와줘서 정말 감사합니다만, 바빠서 이만 가봐야 겠군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/018"
msgid "그럼."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/019"
msgid "뭐야, 정말 무례한 아가씨로군요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/020"
msgid "뭐, 고향으로 돌아온 인사라고 생각하지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/021"
msgid "자, 그보다는 이 근방에 조그만 마을이 있을 거야./30d 오늘은 그곳에서 묵도록 하자."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/022"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/023"
msgid "칫, 매복하고 있었군!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl06_xx
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl06_xx|@kfl06_xx/024"
msgid "/2c제국령 카라카스 지방"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/000"
msgid "카라카스 지방"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/001"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/002"
msgid "……후. "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/003"
msgid "이봐!/40d/n숨어있지 말고 그냥 나오지 그래?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/004"
msgid "헤헷…/25d 역시 들켰네~?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/005"
msgid "더 이상 상관없다고 했을 텐데…/50d/n왜 도둑고양이 마냥 슬금슬금 따라오는 거야?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/006"
msgid "따라온다니 무슨 말씀?/40d/n음…/20d 저는… 그냥… "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/007"
msgid "그냥 뭐!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl07_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl07_s01|@kfl07_s01/008"
msgid "아니~/20d 그냥 뭐…/30d/n내 갈 길을 가는…/25d 중인데…"
msgstr ""

