msgctxt "field|re|art_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/008"
msgid "클라우제비츠,/40d 안타나나리보는 북동쪽 산 넘어 고원지대에 있다고 했던가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/009"
msgid "네,/10d 그렇습니다./35d/n비프로스트에 거의 접경해 있습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/010"
msgid "제가 조사한 바로는,/30d/n영지 전체가 요새화 되어있으니 주의할 필요가 있습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl10_s07
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl10_s07|@kfl10_s07/011"
msgid "알겠소./35d/n그럼 다녀오지."
msgstr ""

