msgid "여러분,/30d 조금 전/25d 프레데릭의 전령이 도착했습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/059"
msgid "내용이 흥미롭더군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/060"
msgid "프레데릭이/20d 왜/15d 제피르 팰컨에게…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/061"
msgid "비프로스트군의/20d 제국 침공이 시작된 모양입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/062"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/063"
msgid "설마…/20d 중립국인 비프로스트가?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/064"
msgid "어느 정도 예견된 일이지./45d/n비프로스트가 군비를 늘리기 시작한 것이/35d 하루 이틀의 일이 아니니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/065"
msgid "그렇습니다만,/30d/n지금은/25d 상황이 조금 애매하다고 할 수 있겠군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/066"
msgid "아무래도/30d 밀사로 파견된/25d 마키아벨리의 영향이/n큰 것 같습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/067"
msgid "젠장!/35d 역시 그때 그 자식을 없애 버렸어야 했어./45d/n이게 다 당신 탓이라고,/20d 시라노!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/068"
msgid "그래서,/30d 그 일과 프레데릭의 전령은 무슨 연관이 있지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/069"
msgid "프레데릭은/30d 체사레 추기경의 뜻과는 달리,/35d 비프로스트와 싸울 생각인가 봅니다./50d/n그래서/25d 제피르 팰컨에게/20d 협력을 요청한다는군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/070"
msgid "대단한 사람이군./35d/n적에게 함께 싸우자는 요청을 하다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/071"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/072"
msgid "클라우제비츠는 어떻게 생각하고 있지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/073"
msgid "외세를 끌어들일 수는 없는 일이지요./45d/n제국 입장에서 보면/30d 이것은 명백한 침략 행위입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/074"
msgid "여러분들의 의견은 어떠신지요./50d/n다른 생각을 가지신 분은 없으십니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/075"
msgid "나는 찬성."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/076"
msgid "비프로스트 놈들에게/20d 제국을 빼앗길 수는 없지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/077"
msgid "다른 분들은…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/078"
msgid "이 중에서 반대할 사람이 누가 있겠어./45d/n자,/20d 빨리 비프로스트 놈들을 쳐부수자고!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/079"
msgid "그럼,/25d 우리 모두의 일치된 의견으로 하겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/080"
msgid "비프로스트군의 규모는?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/081"
msgid "약/15d 20만 정도라고 합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/082"
msgid "20만…/45d 정말 엄청난 숫자네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/083"
msgid "그렇습니다./35d 우리가/15d 프레데릭군과 합세해도,/35d/n제국군 측은/20d 약 13만 정도./45d/n숫자로는 상대가 되지 않겠지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/084"
msgid "그래서,/15d 방법은?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/085"
msgid "병력의 수가 열세일때/35d 효과적인 전법은/25d 방어,/20d 기습전 뿐이지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/086"
msgid "천연 요새라 할 수 있는 인페르노를/40d 비프로스트로부터 탈환할 겁니다./35d/n그리고/20d 방어 요새로 사용하는 거지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/087"
msgid "확실히,/10d 그렇군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/088"
msgid "프레데릭 장군도/30d 같은 생각인 것 같습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/089"
msgid "인페르노인가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/090"
msgid "자,/35d 출격은 내일 새벽입니다./35d/n그때까지/25d 충분히 휴식을 취하시길 바랍니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/091"
msgid "아, 그리고./30d 새로운 검을 입수했습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/092"
msgid "PS-7/25d '블릿츠'./35d 다들 잘 알고 계시죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/093"
msgid "블릿츠라면,/20d 팬드래건의…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/094"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/095"
msgid "팬드래건의 제식검은/25d 외부 반출을 엄격히 단속하고/n있을텐데?!/45d 게다가 블릿츠는 최상위급 검이잖아요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/096"
msgid "뭐…/40d 운이 조금 좋았을 뿐입니다./30d/n일단 이 검은/30d 시라노 님과 메디치 님이 사용해 주시지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/097"
msgid "맞습니다./30d PS-7은/30d 팬드래건의 제식검인/30d/n팬드래건 소드 시리즈의 최신형입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/098"
msgid "위력도 위력이지만,/35d 무엇보다도 가볍고/20d 수리가 쉬워/25d/n유용하게 사용할 수 있겠지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s03|@kfl13_s03/099"
msgid "나도 마찬가지야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/000"
msgid "리브레빌, 에스테 저택"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/001"
msgid "그럼 내일부터/25d 프레데릭군과 함께 싸우는건가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/002"
msgid "기분이 묘하네./35d 어제까지만 해도 적이었는데."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/003"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/004"
msgid "비프로스트 공왕도 대단하군./45d/n감히 제국을 침공할 생각을 하다니!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/005"
msgid "그것도 다/25d 조세핀이란 여자 때문이라던데."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/006"
msgid "남자들은 다 똑같다니까."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/007"
msgid "그러고 보니,/25d 메디치 형님은 어디 간거지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/008"
msgid "조금 전에/15d 에스테와 함께 나가던데요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/009"
msgid "쳇…/40d 역시 그런건가."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s04|@kfl13_s04/010"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

