msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/016"
msgid "변명은 됐다./40d 어서 집으로 돌아가거라."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/017"
msgid "아…/30d 아버지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/018"
msgid "아버지?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/019"
msgid "아버지라니…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/020"
msgid "…/45d어머니가 걱정하고 계신다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/021"
msgid "…하지만!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/022"
msgid "크리스티나!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/023"
msgid "…네,/30d 알겠어요…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/024"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/025"
msgid "제피르 팰컨 여러분,/40d 그동안 정말 감사했습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/026"
msgid "이야기는 들으셨겠지만,/35d 여러분을 속이는 모양새가 되어 버려서 죄송합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/027"
msgid "지금부터는 함께 싸우지 못하겠네요…/60d/n아마도,/30d 카나 씨가 제 몫만큼/15d 더 열심히 해 주실거라 믿습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/028"
msgid "왜 하필 나야!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/029"
msgid "그보다, 크리스!/25d 제대로 설명을 해 봐./20d/n남장은 뭐고/15d 아버지는 뭔데!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/030"
msgid "…/10d죄송합니다./45d 이만 가보겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/031"
msgid "크리스…/35d 크리스티나…/40d/n프레데릭 경의 딸이었군요…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl13_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl13_s05|@kfl13_s05/032"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s01|@kfl14_s01/000"
msgid "프레데릭군 막사"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s01|@kfl14_s01/001"
msgid "그럼,/30d 작전 회의를 시작하겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s01|@kfl14_s01/002"
msgid "모두/25d 지도를 주목해 주십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s01|@kfl14_s01/003"
msgid "제 14 장"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s01|@kfl14_s01/004"
msgid "드래건 스트라이크 작전"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/000"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/001"
msgid "아아…/40d/n아무리 그래도/30d 13만을 2만으로 막는 건,/35d 무리가 아닌가 해서…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/002"
msgid "단지 견제일 뿐,/30d 절대로/20d 적과 정면승부를 해서는 안됩니다./40d/n인페르노의 지형을 이용해/25d 적의 발목을 잡는 정도면 충분합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/003"
msgid "좋아요,/20d 그 정도라면 가능하겠군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/004"
msgid "타이밍이 매우 중요합니다./45d/n시라노 님과의 연계 공격으로/30d 적을 혼란시켜 주십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/005"
msgid "쳇…/30d 남들은 다 싸우는데/35d 나만 뒤에서 구경이나 해야 한다니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/006"
msgid "아닙니다./40d/n만약 보급로가 끊기기라도 한다면,/35d 상황은/30d 아군에게 극히 불리하게 전개됩니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/007"
msgid "이 작전의 가장 중요한 역할을/40d 리델 님이 담당하고 있다는 것을/25d 명심해 주십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/008"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/009"
msgid "이 작전을/40d 드래건 스트라이크라고 칭합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/010"
msgid "제국의 운명이 달려있는/30d 중요한 작전입니다./45d/n모두,/25d 최선을 다 해 주십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/011"
msgid "자세한 사항은/30d 후에 개별적으로 알려 드리겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/012"
msgid "과연,/25d 현자 클라우제비츠./50d/n이런 작전을 생각해 내다니,/35d 훌륭한 전술이오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/013"
msgid "이자벨 님은/30d 하실 말씀이 있으신 것 같군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/014"
msgid "과찬이십니다./45d/n이것은/20d 흑태자의 사선대형을/25d 나름대로 연구해 적용한 것일 뿐입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/015"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/016"
msgid "프레데릭 장군님!/30d 연설 준비가 되었습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/017"
msgid "그래, 알겠네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s02|@kfl14_s02/018"
msgid "여러분,/30d 잠시 실례하겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/000"
msgid "제피르 팰컨 보급로, 리델 진영"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/001"
msgid "리델,/15d 무슨 일이야?/30d/n이 중요한 때에 나를 불러내고."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/002"
msgid "형님,/40d 잠시/15d 이리로 와 보시겠습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/003"
msgid "…/35d그러지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/004"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/005"
msgid "형님,/30d 불공평하다고 생각하지 않습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/006"
msgid "예전에는/20d 형님과 제가 항상 최전선에서 활약을 했었는데,/50d 지금은 이게 뭡니까!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/007"
msgid "공은 모두 시라노와 프레데릭이 세우고,/40d/n우리는 고작 후방에서/25d 길목이나 지키고 있는 신세라니요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/008"
msgid "리델,/10d 그 마음은 이해한다./30d/n하지만 전쟁에서 무엇보다도 중요한 것은/20d 보급로 확보라는 걸/25d 너도 잘 알고있지 않나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/009"
msgid "그래요,/25d 바로 그겁니다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/010"
msgid "보급로가 중요한건/25d 적도 마찬가지죠./35d/n저들도 보급로가 끊어지면/30d 아무리 대군이라도/20d 혼란에 빠진다는 겁니다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/011"
msgid "적의 보급로가 끊어진 지금이야말로/50d 카타리나군을 칠 절호의 기회라구요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/012"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/013"
msgid "형님,/30d 뭘 그리 망설입니까?/35d/n우리가 나서서/30d 저들의 코를 납작하게 만들어 주자구요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/014"
msgid "내가 아는 형님은,/30d 이렇게 약한 모습을 보이실 리가 없을텐데요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/015"
msgid "아,/10d 형님!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/016"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/017"
msgid "그래…/35d 언제까지나 이렇게 있을 수만은 없지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/018"
msgid "좋아!/40d 우리의 실력을 보여주자!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/019"
msgid "역시!/35d 이제야 형님다운 말씀을 하시는군요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s03|@kfl14_s03/020"
msgid "자!/25d 그럼 진격이다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl14_s04
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl14_s04|@kfl14_s04/000"
msgid "/2c비프로스트 병참기지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/000"
msgid "축하합니다,/15d 프레데릭 장군님./30d/n장군의 용병술이 아니었다면/30d 오늘의 승리는 없었을 것입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/001"
msgid "하하./70d 이번 전투의 승리는/45d 단지 나와 클라우제비츠 군사의 작전의 성과만은/45d/n아니라는 건 알고 있소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/002"
msgid "서로의 단결된 힘이 있었기에 가능했던 것이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/003"
msgid "우리의 작전은/40d 그것을 뒷받침 해준 것에 지나지 않을 뿐이지 않겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/004"
msgid "맞는 말씀입니다./40d/n이번 전투는/20d 제국의 역사에 길이 남을/20d 성공적인 전투가 되었으니,/30d/n축하하지 않을 수 없겠지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/005"
msgid "그러고 보니,/30d 이번 전투의 영웅은 어디 계신지?/65d/n회색 망토의 검사라는 분 말이오./55d 축배를 한잔 들고 싶소만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/006"
msgid "시라노 님 말씀이시군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/007"
msgid "후방 부대의 실수로 무너졌던 전선을,/45d 그가 신속히/15d/n보급로를 탈환해 준 덕분에/25d 만회할 수 있지 않았겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/008"
msgid "아,/30d 저기 그가 보이는군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/009"
msgid "시라노,/20d 우리도 다 같이 축하하러 가요!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/010"
msgid "미안하지만 자리를 좀 비켜주지 않겠나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/011"
msgid "시라노…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/012"
msgid "내버려둬,/10d 카나./25d/n시라노에게도/25d 하고자 하는 일이 있으니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/013"
msgid "응…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/014"
msgid "시라노,/40d 오늘은 정말 수고가 많으셨소이다./65d/n이번 전투의 영웅을 위해/30d 축배를 나누고 싶소이다만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/015"
msgid "…그것도 나쁘지는 않겠지./55d/n하지만,/35d 당신과 잔을 들기 전에/30d 하고 싶은 일이 있소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/016"
msgid "무슨…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/017"
msgid "알프레드 프레데릭 장군,/60d 당신에게 결투를 신청하겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/018"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/019"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/020"
msgid "!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/021"
msgid "갑자기 무슨 말이에요,/20d 시라노!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/022"
msgid "하하하,/70d 농담이 지나치시군요./55d/n나의 검술로/35d 어떻게 제국령 최고의 검사와 대적을 할 수 있겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/023"
msgid "내 말을 잘 이해하지 못한 모양이군./70d/n당신과 검술 대련을 하고 싶은게 아니오./40d 내가 원하는 건/35d 당신의 목숨이오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/024"
msgid "시라노 님…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/025"
msgid "흐음…/75d 곤란하군./55d/n당신이 내게 무슨 악감정이 있는지는 모르겠지만,/55d/n지금은 우리 연합군의 승리를 축하하는 연회 중이지 않소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/026"
msgid "설사 당신과의 결투를 받아들인다 하더라도,/70d/n이 자리에서는 할 수 없소이다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/027"
msgid "내일 아침 동 트기 직전,/60d 장소는 바로 이 계곡의 뒷 봉우리./45d/n물론,/30d 단신으로."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/028"
msgid "늦지 않길 바라겠소."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/029"
msgid "정말 무례한 사람이로군!/60d/n그런 일방적인 결투 신청은/15d 받아들일 수 없소!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/030"
msgid "일방적인 결투 신청?/70d/n무고한 상대를 결투라는 이름으로 죽인 자가,/40d 자신은 받아들일 수 없다는 건가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/031"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/032"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/033"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/034"
msgid "프레데릭 경이/15d 이쪽으로 오고 계세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/035"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/036"
msgid "…무슨 이유가 있는지는 모르겠지만,/55d 그렇게까지 말하니 어쩔 수 없군./55d/n좋소,/40d 결투를 받아들이지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/037"
msgid "하지만,/20d 이 결투를 받아들이는 것은/40d/n결코 당신의 말이 옳기 때문이 아니오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/038"
msgid "지금까지의 나의 행동에/40d 한 점 부끄러움이 없음을 밝히기 위해/55d/n당신의 결투를 받아들이는 것 뿐이오!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/039"
msgid "두고 보면 알게 될 일이겠지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/040"
msgid "시라노 님,/35d 대체 무슨 일입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/041"
msgid "군사에게는 미안하게 됐군./45d/n나 때문에 이 연합에 차질이 생길테니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s01|@kfl15_s01/042"
msgid "그건 그렇겠지만,/35d/n시라노 님의 이런 행동에는/40d 무언가 이유가 있으리라 생각합니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s01
