msgid "미안하네,/25d 클라우제비츠."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/026"
msgid "시라노 님!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/027"
msgid "…생각할 시간을 주게."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/028"
msgid "…/40d알겠습니다./40d 시라노 님의/10d 판단에 맡기겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/029"
msgid "메르세데스…/65d/n하지만 나를 따라준/15d 실버와 카나,/25d 에스메랄다는…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/030"
msgid "가장 먼저 떠오르는 사람은 누구인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/031"
msgid "나에게는 메르세데스가 가장 중요하다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl15_s05|@kfl15_s05/032"
msgid "실버에게 작별인사도 하지 않고 갈 수는 없다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl15_s05
