msgid "정말이지…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/024"
msgid "리델 당신은/30d 메디치 밖에 모르는 거야?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/025"
msgid "뭐라고?!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/026"
msgid "하하하…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/027"
msgid "[크리스티나]/n저…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/028"
msgid "[크리스티나]/n…시라노 씨./45d 떠나시는 이유를 알려주실 수 있을까요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/029"
msgid "…그건…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/030"
msgid "…나는 새로운 세계를 보고 싶어 떠나는 거야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/031"
msgid "그곳은 대륙의 동부일지도,/45d 외딴 섬일지도…/35d 어쩌면/35d 동방 대륙일지도 모르지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/032"
msgid "내가 모르는 새로운 곳에서,/40d 새로운 것을 보고 싶다고 생각했다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/033"
msgid "아니요,/30d 단지 그런 이유만은 아니시겠지요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/034"
msgid "…지금까지의 일에서/30d 나는 깨달은 것이 있어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/035"
msgid "복수의 끝에 서도/45d 새로운 희망이 피어나진 않아."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/036"
msgid "증오를 지울 수 있는 것은,/40d 그것을 넘어선 마음의 평화뿐./80d/n부정적인 감정으로는/30d 아무것도 얻는 것이 없다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/037"
msgid "내 안에서 용서하는 마음을 끌어내는 것만이…/65d/n증오에서 자유로울 수 있는/45d 유일한 방법이라는 것을 깨달았어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/038"
msgid "시라노…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/039"
msgid "그래서 나는,/40d 불행했던 과거의 기억은 이 땅에 묻어두고 떠나고 싶다고 생각했다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/040"
msgid "아름다운 추억들만 가슴에 묻은 채로,/60d/n나를 모르는 새로운 곳에서/45d 새로운 세계를 경험하려고 한다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/041"
msgid "그렇군요…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/042"
msgid "복수의 굴레를 벗어나/40d 스스로의 평안을 위해 살아가실 수 있다면,/50d/n우리도/25d 시라노 님을 기쁘게 보내드릴 수 있겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/043"
msgid "[크리스티나]/n저기…/35d 시라노 씨…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/044"
msgid "크리스티나…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/045"
msgid "[크리스티나]/n마지막으로 여쭐 것이…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/046"
msgid "[크리스티나]/n…당신은/30d 누구십니까…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/047"
msgid "그건…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/048"
msgid "[메디치]/n어이~/45d 시라노!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/049"
msgid "[크리스티나]/n아…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/050"
msgid "하하,/30d 이거 미안하군./25d 또 늦어버렸네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/051"
msgid "[보르스]/n정말이지…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/052"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/053"
msgid "시간에 맞춰서 다행이다…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/054"
msgid "길을 잃은 여자애의 엄마를 찾아다녔다니까요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/055"
msgid "[카나]/n메디치 오빠!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/056"
msgid "이런 때까지 지각이에요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/057"
msgid "당신은 정말…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/058"
msgid "하하하…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/059"
msgid "뭐,/15d 평소의 형님답게 유쾌해서 좋잖아?/40d 하하."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/060"
msgid "시라노…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/061"
msgid "당신이 떠난다니,/20d 솔직히 섭섭한 마음이 드는군./80d/n우리가 당신에게 의지하고 있었다는 걸 새삼 깨닫는다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/062"
msgid "…로베르토 데 메디치."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/063"
msgid "당신의 은혜는 잊지 않겠다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/064"
msgid "당신이 없었다면/50d 나는 아무것도 할 수 없었을 거야./40d/n모든 것은 당신으로부터 시작된 것이다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/065"
msgid "…당신과 함께 싸워왔던 날들을,/30d 결코 잊지 않겠어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/066"
msgid "…/30d그래."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/067"
msgid "카나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/068"
msgid "응?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/069"
msgid "너에게도 신세를 많이 졌다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/070"
msgid "실버와 에스메랄다도."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/071"
msgid "…저기,/15d 시라노?/30d 혹시 우리를 두고 떠날 생각이에요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/072"
msgid "설마,/30d 저까지 떼어버리고 가실 생각은 아니시겠죠?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/073"
msgid "…나는 정처 없는 길을 떠날 거야./55d/n비로소 제국에 평화를 되찾았으니,/55d/n이제 여러분도 자신들의 노력의 대가를 받아야 할 때야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/074"
msgid "생각은 고맙지만,/40d 내 뒤를 따를 필요는 없어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/075"
msgid "시라노,/30d 벌써 잊으신 건 아니시겠죠."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/076"
msgid "당신의 힘이 되어드리겠다 한 약속,/40d 저는 끝까지 지킬 겁니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/077"
msgid "저도 지금까지/30d 많은 것을 배웠습니다./60d/n시라노 님의 마음 속 상처를 보았을 때,/45d/n저는 당신을 치유하겠다 마음 먹고 여기까지 왔어요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl24_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl24_s01|@kfl24_s01/078"
msgid "하지만 당신은/30d 스스로의 힘으로 일어섰지요./55d/n저는 시라노 님의 강인한 모습에서,/50d 살아가는 의미를 더 배우고 싶어요."
msgstr ""

