msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/006"
msgid "수중도시 입구"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/007"
msgid "…/50d시끄럽군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/008"
msgid "그렇게나 못마땅하면/60d 이제 내 뒤를 따르지 않으면 그만 아닌가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/009"
msgid "시…/25d 시라노…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/010"
msgid "말씀이 심하시군요./45d 우리는 당신 때문에 두 명의 부대장을 잃었습니다./60d/n그런데도/30d 그런 무책임한 말씀을…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/011"
msgid "분명히 경고하지./65d/n더 이상 내 행동에 왈가왈부 하는 자는/50d 모두 없애버리겠어."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/012"
msgid "시라노 님…/50d 흐흑…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/013"
msgid "에스메랄다 님!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/014"
msgid "에스메랄다는/50d 내 행동이 잘못되었다고 생각하는 모양이군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/015"
msgid "…미안합니다./40d 우리가 당신을/15d 이 지경이 될 때까지 몰아온 것 같군요./45d 저의 불찰입니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/016"
msgid "하지만/30d 우리에게는 대의가 있습니다./50d/n지금 당신의 행동은/30d 우리 제피르 팰컨의 뜻과는 맞지 않습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/017"
msgid "앞으로 제피르 팰컨은/45d 당신과는 별개로 행동할 것임을 말씀드립니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/018"
msgid "시라노…/45d 이제는…/30d 나도 당신을 믿을 수 없어요…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/019"
msgid "누군가가 나를 믿어주길 바란 적은 없어./75d/n믿음 따위는/30d 나의 복수에 걸림돌이 될 뿐이다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/020"
msgid "모두 들었지?/40d 이의를 다는 자는 필요없어./50d/n어때?/20d 그래도 우리를 따를 사람 있나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/021"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/022"
msgid "알겠습니다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/023"
msgid "됐다, 실버./45d 더 이상 지체할 이유는 없어./45d/n어서 체사레를 쫓는다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/024"
msgid "…!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/025"
msgid "제 23 장"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s01
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s01|@kfl26_s01/026"
msgid "복수의 광시곡"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/000"
msgid "기다려라,/5d 체사레…/35d 이제 도망갈 곳은 없다…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/001"
msgid "[카타리나]/n멈춰라,/30d 시라노!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/002"
msgid "!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/003"
msgid "!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/004"
msgid "카타리나,/30d 클라우제비츠…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/005"
msgid "미안합니다,/5d 시라노./35d 우리는 더 이상/20d 당신의 파괴 행각을 두고만 볼 수 없습니다./50d/n이제 그만 칼을 거두십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/006"
msgid "하,/45d 나를 막겠다고/30d 비프로스트와도 손을 잡은 것인가?/50d/n후후…/45d 우습군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/007"
msgid "어디,/40d 막을 수 있으면 막아 보시지!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/008"
msgid "시라노,/20d 여기는 제게 맡기십시오."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/009"
msgid "무슨 소리냐, 실버./45d 우리 둘이라면/30d 저들도 어쩌지 못해."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/010"
msgid "하지만 여기서 시간을 끌면/20d/n당신의 숙원을 이루지 못할지도 모릅니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/011"
msgid "체사레를 놓칠 수도 있다는 말인가."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/012"
msgid "여기까지 왔는데/25d 무위로 돌아가게 할 순 없습니다./25d/n어서 체사레의 뒤를 쫓아가세요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/013"
msgid "실버…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/014"
msgid "당신의 숙원은 저의 숙원이나 마찬가지./40d/n당신이 만족할 수 있다면/30d 저는 더 바랄 게 없습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/015"
msgid "…/45d고맙다,/10d 실버."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/016"
msgid "언제까지 쑥덕거리고만 있을 거냐!/50d/n칼을 버리지 못하겠다면/40d 죽음을 각오해야 할 것이다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/017"
msgid "시라노는 너희들 따위와 상대할 시간은 없어./55d/n너희들의 상대는/25d 나 하나로도 충분해!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/018"
msgid "훗,/60d 결국 끝장을 보겠다는 거군!/60d/n좋아./45d 얼마나 버틸지 두고 보자! "
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/019"
msgid "덤벼라!/30d 나를 죽일 수는 있어도/30d 결코 시라노를 방해할 수는 없을거다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/020"
msgid "방해하는 자는/15d 모두 없애버리겠다고 경고했을 텐데,/60d/n어쩔 수 없군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/026"
msgid "정신 차려라,/5d 시라노!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s02
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s02|@kfl26_s02/027"
msgid "부탁이에요,/10d 시라노…/30d 제발 그만해요…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/000"
msgid "이제 곧 시라노가 이곳으로 올라올 것입니다./45d/n어서 피신하시는 것이…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/001"
msgid "그럴 필요는 없네./45d 내 계획은 이미 이룬 셈이니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/002"
msgid "제국의 통일 말씀이시군요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/003"
msgid "그래./30d 시라노 놈이 여기까지 쫓아온 이상,/50d 비프로스트에도/25d 위협이 된다는 걸 조정에서도 잘 알고 있을 테지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/004"
msgid "조금만 있으면/30d 제국령의 영주들,/30d 제피르 팰컨,/30d/n게다가 비프로스트까지 협력해서/20d 놈을 제거하려 들 걸세."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/005"
msgid "하지만 추기경 각하,/50d 시라노는 위험한 남자입니다./45d/n일단 몸을 피하시는 것이 좋지 않겠습니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/006"
msgid "각하께선/30d 앞으로 통일 제국을 이끌어 나갈/30d/n소중한 몸이시니까요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/007"
msgid "후후,/60d 놈이 나를 쓰러트릴 수 있을 것 같나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/008"
msgid "나는 파괴신의 힘으로/30d 신의 몸이 되었지./55d/n그래,/20d 불사신이란 말이다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/009"
msgid "[시라노]/n체사레!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/010"
msgid "네놈이 불사신이 되었는지는/45d 내 칼로 확인해 주마."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/011"
msgid "하,/40d 역시 대단한 집념이야./45d/n그런 면에서는/15d 나와 비슷할지도 모르겠군."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/012"
msgid "너 따위와 비교하지 마라."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/013"
msgid "아,/10d 미안하군./30d 동료마저 그 손으로 죽여버린 네놈이/30d/n훨씬 더러운 손인데 말이야."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/014"
msgid "길게 얘기할 생각은 없다./50d/n내가 원하는 건 네놈의 목숨./40d 그걸로 충분해!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/015"
msgid "내 목숨을 가져갈 수 있다고 생각하나,/30d 시라노!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
msgctxt "field|re|art_fl26_s03|@kfl26_s03/016"
msgid "제국을 통일하는 영웅!/60d 나는/45d 신이다!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fl26_s03
