msgid "좋은 칼이긴 하지만, 상당히 낡았기 때문에…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/005"
msgid "그 명검을… 명검을 이렇게 보관했다니!/n잠시 기다려 보게! 내가 고쳐줄 테니."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/006"
msgid "엑스칼리버가 수리되었습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/007"
msgid "당신… 혹시 파즈라는 사람인가?/n정말 고맙다, 이 칼을 고쳐주어서."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/008"
msgid "내 이름을 아나보군. 괜찮다./n이 명검을 고쳤다는 것만으로도… 잘 가게나."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/009"
msgid "나? 글쎄… 과연 내가 누구지…/n엇! 당신 이상한 칼을 갖고 있군!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/010"
msgid "이런 외지고 위험한 곳에서… 무엇을 하고 계신 것입니까?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/011"
msgid "[파즈]/n흠… 나 말인가. 파즈라고 하네./n평생동안 검을 수리하면서 다녔지만,/n세상에 허무를 느끼고 이곳에 와서 지내고 있다네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/012"
msgid "하지만, 이런 곳에서… 외롭거나 무섭지 않으세요?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/013"
msgid "[파즈]/n무섭냐고? 하하하… 나도 옛날에는 이름난 검사였지./n이곳의 몬스터들은 절대로 나를 해치지 못해."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/014"
msgid "[파즈]/n하지만, 단지… 가끔가다 정말로/n좋은 칼이 보고 싶을 때가 있다네./n이올린 팬드래건의 엑스칼리버라던지,/n팬드래건 가문의 바리사다나,/n혹은 투르족이 쓴다는 광선검…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/015"
msgid "엑스칼리버… 그 낡은 칼 말인가?/n그게 그렇게 명검이었단 말인가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/016"
msgid "[파즈]/n당신… 그 칼을 갖고 있단 말인가?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/017"
msgid "그 엑스칼리버가 상당히 낡은 칼을/n말한다면 갖고 있습니다만."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/018"
msgid "[파즈]/n그 칼을 갖고 있다면, 잠깐 보여줄 수 없겠나./n이 늙은이의 소원일세."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/019"
msgid "좋습니다. 어려운 것도 아닌데요./n너무 낡아서 더 이상 쓰지 않는 칼인데."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/020"
msgid "낡은 엑스칼리버를 꺼냈다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/021"
msgid "[파즈]/n이것은… 그 전설의 칼 엑스칼리버가 아닙니까, 신이시여…/n그런데, 상당히 낡았군… 자네, 내가 이 칼을 고쳐도 되겠나?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/022"
msgid "그 낡은 칼을 고치시겠다고요?/n너무 낡아서 아무도 고칠 생각을 안하던 칼이었는데…/n좋습니다. 못쓰던 칼이 쓸만 해진다면 저도 좋지요."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/023"
msgid "[파즈]/n쓸만한 검이라… 좋아/n내가 정말 '쓸만한' 검이란 무엇을 의미하는지 알려주지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/024"
msgid "엑스칼리버가 수리되었다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/025"
msgid "이, 이 검은…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/026"
msgid "[파즈]/n어떤가…!/n이것이 바로 진정한 명검, 엑스칼리버라네!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/027"
msgid "이 검은… 이 빛나는 검신과 날카로운 칼날! 강한 공격력을 상징하는 검광과 든든한 방어력을 느끼게 하는 이 묵직함! 그러면서도 들지 않은듯 움직여진다. 이것이야 말로 명검…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/028"
msgid "이렇게 완벽하게 이 칼을 수리하시다니…/n정말 대단하십니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/029"
msgid "[파즈]/n하하하! 이 정도는 아무것도 아니지! 어떤 검이라도/n가져만 오라고 120퍼센트 업그레이드 해 주지!/n팬드래건의 바리사다든 뭐든 가져만 오라고! 하하하!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/030"
msgid "(이 사람 정말로 세상에 환멸을 느끼고 숨어있는 것일까…)/n고맙습니다, 파즈 씨. 이 은혜 잊지 않겠습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/031"
msgid "나는 파즈라고 하네."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma17
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma17|@kfldma17/032"
msgid "예전에는 이름을 날린 검 전문가였네만…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/000"
msgid "이… 이건…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/001"
msgid "전설의 소환수 유니콘…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/002"
msgid "살아 있는 건가…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/003"
msgid "그대는… 누구인가…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/004"
msgid "……!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/005"
msgid "이곳에… 올 수 있다니…/n평범한 인간은… 아닌 것 같군…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/006"
msgid "당신은…?"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/007"
msgid "나에게… 이름은… 없네…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/008"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/009"
msgid "그런데… 자네의 몸에서는…/n두 개의 영혼이… 느껴지는군…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/010"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/011"
msgid "한 명은…/n강력한 의지를… 가지고 있는… 인간…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/012"
msgid "그리고… 또 한 명은…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/013"
msgid "……!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/014"
msgid "자네라면… 다룰 수 있을지도… 모르겠군…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/015"
msgid "이걸… 주겠네…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/016"
msgid "그것은… 소환수의 각인…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/017"
msgid "!!!!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/018"
msgid "앗…!"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/019"
msgid "일각수의 뿔을 입수하였습니다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/020"
msgid "……"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/021"
msgid "나를 부른다면…/n언제라도… 자네의 힘이… 되어주지."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/022"
msgid "이곳은… 들이마시는 공기마저… 얼어붙는…/n극한의 공간… 이제… 이곳을 떠나게…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/023"
msgid "이곳은… 엄청난 한기로 가득 차 있다."
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldma20
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldma20|@kfldma20/024"
msgid "어서… 이곳을 떠나게…"
msgstr ""

#. group=field; variant=re; bundle=ZephyrRemastered_Data/StreamingAssets/aa/StandaloneWindows64/fieldtext.re_assets_all_289a30d75d4cf39579a250647a71d81b.bundle; object=art_fldpr13
msgctxt "field|re|art_fldpr13|@kfldpr13/000"
msgid "[해적 키드]/n후후후… 자네인가? 나의 잠을 깨우는 자가./n3번까지는 봐 주지."
msgstr ""

